globalThis.CHARACTER_DIALOGUE = {"revision":"a5b29b8686d49453f5a47c0dbef7b326a2bf810a","entries":{"npc-laura":[{"place":"Swamp Cave","passages":["Oh! Are you the hero?! You've come to rescue me, haven't you?!","I see...","I want to go back to the castle, where Father and everyone are waiting...","I see... Oh, Father...","Of course... With a monster like that to contend with...","Oh, I'm so happy! ...Blush. Please lift me into your arms and carry me back to the castle!","I-it's all right. You're still so small...! That's why you couldn't lift me. Isn't that right?! ...Or rather, please tell me that's the reason!","Please! Please say it's true!","Whew... What a relief... I-I mean, never mind! I think I shall wait for someone grown up to come along. I have a feeling... A young man in blue armor... He will come for me. I've dreamed of it many times. You were not the hero, but I'm still glad you came. I am Laura, princess of Radatome. I hope we meet again.","I am Laura, princess of Radatome. I hope we meet again."]}],"npc-cobi":[{"place":"Aboard the sailing ship","passages":["Hey! I told you not to get in the way of their work! Ah! Wait!","Good grief. The monsters are having so much fun on the ship, they're getting carried away. If they cause too much trouble, Dad's going to scold me. I wish they'd settle down a little...","...True. I'm getting pretty tired of it myself... [your name], how can you keep staring at the sea without getting bored?","Oh, Dad was looking for [your name]. He couldn't find [your name] anywhere and thought you might have fallen overboard... He was making such a fuss. Go and see him.","What's wrong, [your name]? Dad was looking for you!","[your name]! They say we'll be able to see GreatLog soon!","I know, [your name]! Let's go up to the lookout!","So that's GreatLog! What a huge palm tree! There's no way we could climb a tree that tall, is there?! Even if we did, getting down would be hard!","I wonder what GreatLog is like. I can't wait to see what our new life will be like! Let's go out and explore as soon as we arrive, [your name]!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Castle","passages":["[your name], congratulations! You finally did it! When GreatLog's navel broke, I wondered what would happen... But you and your monsters worked together and saved GreatLog! ...Hm? What's wrong? You look a little down... I see... Traveling with your monster friends... And meeting all sorts of people in new worlds... You'd come to really enjoy it, so you're a little sad it's over, right?"]},{"place":"Beneath GreatLog Castle","passages":["That's ours! We're not giving it to you!","How dare you! Give back our nut pie!","This is terrible! GreatLog is going to sink! Something to replace the navel... Do we have anything like that at home? Oh! Maybe that would work. [your name], let's go home. We have to bring it here!","...What do we do? This is serious! Let's go home and talk it over!"]},{"place":"GreatLog farm","passages":["I told you, it's not mealtime yet! You'll get fat!","Ha ha, we got told off. Let's go see Mom, [your name].","Ha ha! Who knows? [your name], maybe you could become one!","Everyone... Don't panic! This island is going to sink soon!","But we'll work something out, so it'll be fine! Right, [your name]?","It's true, Dad! Why won't you believe us?!","That spirit is the one saying the island will sink if we don't do something!","Hi! I'm helping Dad look after the monsters. You can leave monsters here or take them with you. Taking any friends from the farm today? Or leaving some here?","Hey, [your name]! Tell me about the other worlds sometime! ...I see. The Sea Bell was the wrong size. Leaving it all to [your name] still worries me... Are you all right? I know, I know... We left it to [your name], so I'll have faith. Oh, Dad and I made the farm a little bigger. We can look after more monsters now, so bring plenty!","Taking any friends from the farm today? Or leaving some here?","Hey, [your name]! Tell me more about the other worlds!","...Oh! So Kameha's traveling too? No wonder I haven't seen him lately! Oh, right! The bridge to the island next to the farm is finished. We can look after even more monsters now!","...Hey, [your name]! Isn't it great that GreatLog's back to normal? Now, instead of searching for a navel, let's try collecting monsters! Oh, the barn on the island next to the farm is finished... So you can put monsters into hibernation now!","Hmm, a Demon Lord who collects things... What an odd fellow. We've been having earthquakes all the time in GreatLog... Everyone's saying the island might sink.","I used to envy [your name] for getting to visit other worlds... But lately, I've started enjoying the work here too. The more love you give the monsters, the more they give back.","Welcome back, [your name]. What'll you do today?","Leave it to us, Mom! We'll be fine together. Get the plates ready so we can eat it as soon as we're back!","That's it! This pot should fit that hole perfectly. I'll sneak it out without Mom seeing.","Hey, wait, [your name]. We've still got something to do, remember? We'd better hurry and bring something to replace the navel!","If we don't find a replacement for GreatLog's navel... This house, the farm, and the whole island will sink. We've both got to go to the other world, right?","...But if we both go, Mom will worry.","...You're right. If we both go, Mom will worry.","You look pretty eager to visit another world, [your name].","In that case, I'll leave this to you, [your name]. Give it your best!","[your name], that was mean! You ate my share of the nut pie too... Oh, well. [your name] has a tough journey ahead. Leave the farm to me. Take care out there.","Dad! Our farm's almost finished! I'm getting to know everyone here better too!","At first, I was really worried about how things would go... But [your name] is doing even better than I expected! If it gets too hard, though, I'll trade places with you anytime. ...Not that it'll come to that, huh? Ha ha...","Come on, let's eat too! Mom's lovely cooking will get cold. Let's dig in!"]},{"place":"GreatLog","passages":["Did something happen, [your name]? ...Hey, where's the nut pie? So it was them again! Blast! I'll catch them!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Main Street","passages":["Now I'm angry! Give it back!"]},{"place":"Managing the GreatLog farm","passages":["Welcome home, [your name]. What brings you here today?","Anything else to do?","Who will you release?","You'll never see it again. Release it?","Its accessory will be lost too. Is that all right?","Which will you release?","Come visit the monsters you've left here sometimes!","Keep its accessory, [your name].","...But your inventory is full. I'll send it to storage for you.","...But your inventory and storage are full. Make room in either one and come back.","Which egg will you release?","There are no monsters at the farm!","There are no eggs here!","You'll have no monsters left!","That monster is adventuring online. You cannot take it along.","Releasing it would leave no monsters in your party!","Your monsters look happy to travel with you, [your name]."]}],"npc-eastoria-botanist":[{"place":"Eastoria","passages":["...... ...... ...... ......!","I'm this town's botanist. I've just returned from a journey. As you've probably noticed, for some reason everyone in town... Seems to have completely lost their voice. Birdsong Nectar would restore their voices... But I'm all out of Birdsong Herb, the ingredient I need to make it.","I believe Birdsong Herb grows at the summit of the northern mountain...","Birdsong Nectar can be made from Birdsong Herb. With Birdsong Nectar, we should be able to help everyone. I believe Birdsong Herb grows at the summit of the northern mountain...","...... ...... ...... ......? ...... ...... ......!!","We'll have to ask around town and find out what caused this.","A scholar's research is sometimes misunderstood... It's a great shame."]}],"npc-father":[{"place":"GreatLog farm","passages":["The people here don't seem very used to monsters. We must make sure ours don't wander outside on their own. ...Oh, right. Go and help your mother.","Come on, go run that errand for your mother!","Oh? Didn't you two go on that errand together?","You're supposed to come home with Cobi!","You're supposed to come home with Tara!","Did you just say the island is sinking? Don't talk nonsense. Who told you such a ridiculous story?","All right, all right. Something terrible happened, did it?","But an entire island can't sink that easily. Besides, this kingdom is protected by a spirit's power!","...Good grief. As you know, I'm very busy. I'll play with you another time. Could you leave me be for now? More importantly, did you finish your mother's errand?!","...The sinking island story again? Sorry, but I'm busy. From what I've heard, Warubou and Prince Kameha love playing pranks. I'm sure they've just fooled you.","Hm? Taking a monster with you? Planning to become a master? Listen. Whether you become a master or take over this farm... The most important thing is making friends with monsters. Try giving them meat first. That will help them lower their guard. Then battle the monster and win it over.","Here, try using this meat.","...Do be careful out there.","I believe [your name] will succeed! Do your best! ...That's what my father used to tell me. Your grandfather, that is.","Oh! Looks like you've made friends with a monster! That's my [your name]! You've got a real gift! I was worried a spotted slime might have flattened you... Keep it up, and connect with other monsters too!","The monsters who join you are your treasures. They joined because they trust [your name], after all. Never forget to grow alongside your companions!","If we build a bridge to the next island, we can expand the farm! Beavern is helping us build it.","Beavern helped us build the bridge. Look at it! A fine bridge, isn't it? Next, I'm planning to build an underground barn. Something to look forward to!","Killer Shovel helped us dig the hole. Well? We've built a splendid barn, haven't we? The farm I've dreamed of for so many years is finally complete!","Rumors that GreatLog is sinking are spreading everywhere... At times like this, it's more important than ever to stay calm!","GreatLog was saved thanks to you and your monsters. I'm proud of [your name]!","You've grown so much... You've made your father proud!","Congratulations, [your name]! You've collected every monster! It seems there are no more left for you to collect... You've worked so hard on this long journey. I'm proud of you from the bottom of my heart.","[your name]...Keep taking good care of the monsters!"]}],"npc-greatlog-egg-appraiser":[{"place":"GreatLog egg appraiser","passages":["Oh! N-nice to meet you! I'm the egg appraiser. You don't know what an egg appraiser is... Do you? Um... You see, all monsters hatch from eggs. I appraise the eggs you have. I can predict what sort of monster will hatch... Or bless an egg to change the monster's sex before it hatches. Well then, is there anything I can do for you?","Oh! You're the hero who saved GreatLog! I'm the egg appraiser. Is there anything I can do for you?","Oh... I'm the egg appraiser. May I help you?"]},{"place":"Appraisals and blessings","passages":["Oh... welcome. This is the egg appraiser's shop. How can I help you today?","Which egg shall I appraise?","An appraisal costs […]G. Is that all right?","All right. Please wait a moment! ...Hee hee. Sweet little egg... Let's have a little chat... ...Mutter, mutter... mumble, mumble... I see. Thank you... Thank you for waiting. Here is its appraisal.","Oh... I am sorry, but you do not have enough gold...","Is there anything else you need?","You want its appraisal. Um... here it is!","Which little one shall I bless?","It costs […]G. Is that all right?","W-well, I will do my best! Wiggle-waggle, eggy-egg! GreatLog, pop! Egg, egger, eggest!","...Phew! All done. I hope a lovely child hatches.","Oh... P-please come again.","Oh... You changed your mind...","A wonderful number!","At least 10 for sure!","10 may be difficult...","Keep trying!","Level 99 is in reach!","Over level 50!","Level 50 seems hard...","Even level 30 is hard...","Amazing fiery spirit!","Good and motivated!","I envy its confidence...","Spirited and reliable!","Loves attention.","A little bossy...","A-a rowdy one...","No crisis scares it!","Likes hopeless fights.","Rather unfriendly...","Good and diligent!","Talks only of itself...","Perhaps normal is best.","Good and obedient!","Says it needs no help.","Lives to help others.","Hard to befriend...","It will not like you...","Will excel at study!","Clever, but its attitude...","Scary... so cold...","A very quiet child!","Has a warm heart!","I frightened it...","May be easily fooled...","A little laid-back...","Says it is too much work...","Oh... Um, you do not seem to have any eggs..."]}],"npc-greatlog-hibernation-attendant":[{"place":"GreatLog barn","passages":["Hello, [your name]. Welcome to the barn. This is where we keep monsters asleep while looking after them. Since they sleep the whole time they're here... They don't grow, but they don't become wild again either. Understand how the barn works? Would you like to try hibernation?","This is the barn. What brings you here today?"]},{"place":"Hibernating and waking monsters","passages":["Who will you put into hibernation?","Who will you wake up?","The barn cannot hold any more monsters!","The farm is full. There is nowhere to send it!","Who will you release into the wild?","It has […] equipped. Remove it?","Your inventory is full. I will send it to storage.","You keep the accessory, then.","Anything else you need?","You will never see it again. Release it?","Put […] into hibernation?","Wake […] up?","No monsters at the farm can hibernate!","There are no monsters in the barn!","Come back soon!","...But your inventory and storage are full. Make room in either one and come back.","[…] is adventuring now. You cannot take it along.","[…] is adventuring online and cannot hibernate now.","Releasing […] would leave no monsters in your party."]}],"npc-greatlog-librarian":[{"place":"GreatLog library","passages":["Welcome to the library! You can view the Monster Encyclopedia here. But each master has an individual encyclopedia! Monsters you don't know won't appear in yours. Now, which monster family would you like to study today?","Welcome to the library. Which family would you like to study?","Welcome, little hero! Have you collected lots of monsters? Keep working toward the finest Monster Encyclopedia! Now, which family would you like to look up today?","Ta-da! Congratulations, little hero! Come, take the encyclopedia in your hands! And please accept this egg, passed down here at the library.","...But your farm seems to be full. Please come back once you've made room.","[your name]! I've been waiting for you. Here, take this egg. They say an incredible monster will hatch from it!"]}],"npc-greatlog-storage-clerk":[{"place":"GreatLog storage","passages":["You're the farm children who moved to GreatLog, aren't you? A delicious-smelling package has arrived from your grandmother. Let's see... Ah, here it is. Take it home carefully.","Well done on your errand. Hope to see you again.","The island's sinking?! Hmm... Sorry, but I can't believe that. What? Warubou said so?! Now I believe it even less!","Hello! Back again? This is the storage service. You can deposit and withdraw money and items here. There's no charge, so talk to me anytime. Now then... What can I do for you today?","At times like this, dependable service matters most! Welcome to the storage service. What can I do for you today?","Hello, GreatLog's hero! Still adventuring? Thanks to you, I can keep doing business here. Now then...","Welcome to the storage service. What can I do for you today?"]},{"place":"Deposits and withdrawals","passages":["Which one would you like me to keep?","How much will you deposit?","I will keep it safe for you.","I cannot store any more […].","I cannot hold any more gold.","Need anything else?","You do not have enough gold to make a deposit.","You have nothing to deposit.","Come back again.","Which will you deposit?","Which will you withdraw?","You have no items in storage.","You have not deposited a single gold piece.","Which item will you withdraw?","How much will you withdraw?","You cannot carry that many items.","That will not all fit in your wallet.","There you are. All returned.","How many will you take?","That makes me uneasy... I cannot store it."]}],"npc-greatlog-storage-customer":[{"place":"GreatLog storage","passages":["My journeys to other worlds begin when I collect the items I've stored. Now then, perhaps I'll withdraw my one million gold. Ha ha, just kidding. You can only store up to 999,900 gold.","Even if the island sinks, your stored belongings won't be lost. Don't worry. Safety and trust are what storage is all about!","If your party is wiped out, you lose half the money you're carrying. But money left in storage stays safe. Better safe than sorry. You can travel with peace of mind.","Carrying plenty of money helps on a journey... But if you're wiped out, you lose more. Which is better...?"]}],"npc-greattree-egg-appraiser":[{"place":"GreatTree egg appraiser","passages":["Oh my! What an adorable little boy. What's your name? [your name]... Little [your name], then! I'm the egg appraiser. Delighted to meet you, darling!","Here, I can appraise your eggs... ...and tell you what kind of baby will hatch before it's born! My other service is a blessing. A blessing changes the monster's sex! Understand? What shall we do now?","Oh, [your name], darling! Welcome! What can I do for you today?","Oh! Little [your name]! Welcome back, darling! Where have you been? I've been so lonely. Now then! What can I do for you today?"]},{"place":"Appraisals and blessings","passages":["Well, hello, [your name], darling! Welcome! What can I do for you today?","Which egg shall I appraise?","It costs […]G. Is that all right?","Okay! Wait a moment while I write the appraisal. Sweet little egg! Have a little chat with me! Hmm... Oh my... Really? I see! Thank you! All done! Here is this little one's appraisal!","Oh, [your name], darling! You do not have enough gold. I cannot give even you a discount, [your name]. Sorry!","Anything else I can do for you?","You want to see its appraisal? Here you are!","Which little one needs a blessing?","A blessing costs […]G. Is that all right?","All right! Here we go! Eggy-wiggle, wiggle-egg! GreatTree, pop! Heave-ho!","Phew! All done. I am sure a lovely child will hatch!","Leaving already? Come back soon, darling!","Oh, you changed your mind?","W-what a number!","At least 10!","Let's hope for 10!","A long way to go...","Level 99 is possible!","Level 50 is certain!","Around level 40!","Level 40 or below!","A good, fiery spirit!","Full of motivation!","My! So confident!","Kind and dependable!","A real standout!","Rather bossy...","Quite reckless...","Overcomes any crisis!","Will need support...","Very aloof...","Rigid and studious...","Quite self-absorbed...","Rather ordinary...","Pure and innocent!","Hard to handle...","Loves to help others!","Quite a lone wolf.","Will be disobedient...","Clever, at least...","A little sneaky...","Hurts all it touches!","Extremely quiet...","May be no fighter...","Scared of me? Really!","A little too kind...","Quite unreadable!","Even talking is work...","Oh! You have no eggs. How boring! Stay and do something, darling!"]}],"npc-greattree-librarian":[{"place":"GreatTree library","passages":["Hello, welcome. This is the library. Come to me whenever you want to learn about monsters. I can tell you about any monster you've caught. Which monster family would you like to research today?","This is the library. Which family would you like to research?","Come back whenever you want to consult the monster encyclopedia."]}],"npc-greattree-name-master":[{"place":"Name Master’s Room","passages":["I'm the Name Master. My job is to rename monsters. Come here whenever you want to change a monster's name.","I am a Name Master serving Marinan, the god of names. Whose name would you like to change?"]}],"npc-greattree-storage-clerk":[{"place":"GreatTree storage","passages":["Pleased to meet you. I run the storage service. We can look after the money and items you find on your adventures. Come by whenever you want to deposit or withdraw anything. How may I help you today?","This is the storage service. How may I help you?"]},{"place":"Deposits and withdrawals","passages":["Which one would you like me to keep?","How much will you deposit?","I will keep it safe for you.","I cannot store any more […].","I cannot hold any more gold.","Need anything else?","You do not have enough gold to make a deposit.","You have nothing to deposit.","Come back again.","Which will you deposit?","Which will you withdraw?","You have no items in storage.","You have not deposited a single gold piece.","Which item will you withdraw?","How much will you withdraw?","You cannot carry that many items.","That will not all fit in your wallet.","There you are. All returned.","How many will you take?","That makes me uneasy... I cannot store it."]}],"npc-healie":[{"place":"Departure Gate","passages":["Hello! I'm Healie! You've come to take me back, haven't you? Well, I don't want to go! The farm is boring! I'm not going back! If you insist, you'll have to beat me first!","You can come back as often as you like. I'm not going home!","A strong master like you is sure to keep me entertained!"]}],"npc-kameha":[{"place":"Demon King's Castle","passages":["I never dreamed you were the one gathering those treasures, [your name]. Surprised? That's right! I'm the Demon Lord! While I was looking for a replacement navel, a huge bird carried me off... I found the Orb of Light in a treasure chest in its nest. But the orb wouldn't work as GreatLog's navel. So I used its power to become the Demon Lord and ordered my servants... To find a replacement for me! And they finally did! I'll show you. It's in the next room.","Looks like this could replace the navel, doesn't it? It's the spitting image! This time... No, this whole search for a navel is my victory! I got carried away and kept hunting for treasure, but I'm done now. I'd better get home soon. Dad might be getting worried.","Wh-who are you?! What do you want?!","Wh-wh-wh-what...? What just happened?!","Th-the treasures I had everyone gather! Was that you?! Give them back!","M-my treasures! He took every last one! That creep took my treasures... The ones I had everyone gather! ...Anyway, are you sure about this? Accepting a deal like that... He even wants the treasures you've found to replace the navel... Brought to his castle! It's got to be a trap!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Castle","passages":["Hey, [your name]. You came...","Dad and the others are watching me too closely to sneak out right now... But I'll get back to the other worlds! Go on ahead and wait for me!","I couldn't do a thing, so you win this time. But next time, I'll challenge you as a monster master!","Just you wait! I'll train in the other worlds and show you what I can do! You're my rival, so don't lose to anyone else!"]},{"place":"GreatLog arena district","passages":["Hey, [your name]! Let me tell you something. It turns out I've got a gift for being a monster master. Wh-what's that look for?! You don't believe me at all! Just you wait, [your name]! I'll overtake you in no time!","I've been traveling to other worlds and training as a monster master! Now [your name] can't even hold a candle to me! Want a little battle to find out?","You look confident... Then let's have a match! I can't wait to see what becomes of that confidence afterward!","Here we go!","...What's wrong, [your name]? Afraid of losing?","...Well, today was a bit... You know. My luck, my form, the matchup... Everything was against me. That's the only reason I lost... It was close, right? ...Fine! A loss is a loss. Next time, I won't lose!","Well, let's head back!","Ha ha ha! You're weaker than I expected. I'll take you on again anytime!","Don't be so impatient. Why don't you go and train a little?","Oh, [your name]. Done a little training? No matter how hard you try, I can't see you beating me! Heh heh... Shall we get straight to it?","I lost the match, but I put on the better performance, right? ...Oh, fine! I'll admit defeat! I'd better get back to the castle. Dad'll be getting worried."]},{"place":"Beneath GreatLog Castle","passages":["You just ate! You greedy spirit!","Ow! That hurt! ...Whoa, whoa, whoa!","I-it's not my fault! I had nothing to do with it!","You lot! I'd only just come back from another world when... Ow, ow... Something round came flying at me! I really thought I was done for!","G-GreatLog's life force! Warubou! What are you doing?!","This? I picked it up in another world, but I don't know what it is.","I thought this might work as a replacement navel too!","I told you, I don't know! I just picked it up and brought it back!","I-I'll leave the rest to you, Warubou! I'll go find another replacement...","Shut up! I know that without you telling me! I thought I'd find another replacement navel while I was at it! ...Anyway, I'm going back to the castle! See you!"]},{"place":"GreatLog","passages":["Heh heh! Hey, Grandma! Come and play with me!","This is too good for Warubou! I'm keeping it for myself!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Main Street","passages":["Oh, so these are the newcomers! I'm Kameha, Prince of GreatLog! I'll teach you newcomers the rules of GreatLog!","Hey, let's go, Warubou!","Hey, Warubou! I found something good! Let's try selling it to that shop over there!","So that's how it is?! Now I'm never giving it back!"]},{"place":"Northden Castle","passages":["I thought this kingdom's king was suspicious, so I sneaked in. But they caught me! Then they dropped me down here... Blast it!","Where's the exit!? If we don't find it soon... We're all going to starve to death down here!","So that's where it is! [your name], stand back!","H-hey... [your name]... I-I don't think this is the right spot.","Yes! The wall gave way! I'm going ahead, [your name]!"]},{"place":"Port Ritz and Yord","passages":["Hey! You're [your name] from the farm! Are you looking for something to replace the navel too!?","So you're doing the same as me... Warubou asked you, didn't he?","Those monsters of yours look pretty weak. Look at me! I've already got two followers! I'll definitely find it before you do! Come on, you two! First, we're going to meet the mermaids!","I can see right through your lies!"]},{"place":"Westernia Castle","passages":["Long time no see, [your name]! So this is where you are! Looks like you got out of the northern castle safely. You should be grateful. Listen, I let you take the credit last time... But this time, I'm the one bringing the treasure back to GreatLog!","Is the princess even alive? She's got a face like a doll!","There's one place I'm never going again, and that's a dungeon!"]},{"place":"Volcanic Island Cave","passages":["Ha ha ha! Thanks for leading the way, [your name]! I knew you'd find where the treasure was hidden... So I've been following you! That treasure is mine!","Ack! You've caught up already? You're faster than I thought... Hurry, lads! Follow me!","...Huh? Why do I feel like I'm floating?","Waaaaah!","Out of my way!","I'll find the treasure first!","Blast it... I'll get you for this, [your name]!","Huff... Puff... Finally found it! Now the treasure is mine!","Ouch! That hurt! What do you think you're doing?!","Grrr... You tricked me! You'll pay for this!","I was a fool to trust those creeps. You know what? You can have that treasure. But I won't lose next time! ...See you!"]}],"npc-king-of-assia":[{"place":"Kalkara","passages":["Enough! I know that! I want to know why the water level has fallen! Very well! I'll go and find the cause myself!"]},{"place":"Mirage Lake and the bandits’ hideout","passages":["Why!? We could see the lake, but now that we're close, there's nothing here! At this rate, we'll never find the bandits' hideout!","Bandits! There is no escape! Repent of your crimes and surrender peacefully!","Ah, it's you! Well done finding this place! Leave the rest to us! It's dangerous here, so stand back!","The bandit chief got away!? He's as quick to flee as the rumors say!","His followers are still inside! Capture every last one of them!","Ha ha ha! We've rounded up all the bandits! Now people and monsters alike can live in peace! You've done us a great service. You deserve a reward...","This is the Sea Bell. There's no other treasure like it in my kingdom! It seems to hold mysterious powers. What do you intend to use it for? ...What? To plug a navel? I don't quite follow... Well, use it however you wish!","I've caused you a great deal of trouble, but all is well now. From now on, I shall rule my kingdom with confidence! Visit the castle whenever you like. You'll be most welcome! Farewell..."]},{"place":"Underground Waterway","passages":["Wh-what? Oh, it's you... Stop putting on that strange voice! Y-you won't scare me that easily! I'm going on ahead!","Ah, it's you! Who was making that dreadful voice!? E-even I was a little startled by that!","Only a little startled, mind you! I wasn't afraid! I only came back because I was worried about you! W-well, you seem to be safe, so I'll go ahead! Don't push yourself too hard!","This dam seems to be causing the water shortage. Someone built it here to block the flow of water. I was just trying to work out how to destroy it...","Who's there!? Show yourself and face us openly!","Aha! You've shown yourself! I'd like to say I'll punish you... But if you destroy the dam, I could let you off just this once!","I asked him to destroy the dam, but he won't listen! Hmm... What can we do? There must be some way.","Oh? Then why build a dam in a place like this?","...What!? So that's what happened! Grrr... Those bandits! In that case, I promise to capture them!","Yes, leave it to me! I'm in a hurry, so I'll break through part of the dam on my way out!","Things became a little complicated, but this should solve the town's water shortage! You've been a great help. You have my heartfelt thanks! Come to the castle. I'll give you the Sea Bell as promised."]},{"place":"Assia","passages":["No luck. We searched everywhere, but couldn't find the bandits. Ah, that reminds me! The circus troupe should be here by now. We shall deal with the bandits another day.","Ah, you're the monster tamer from that show. It was a fine performance. Now, is there something you need from me?","Very well. You may go. I look forward to your next show.","What? You want to see my treasure?! Oh, so you've taken an interest in treasure? You have a keen eye.","Hmm! Then let us make a deal. Do me a favor. I succeeded my father, who was a great king... But everything I try ends in failure. Nothing ever goes right. I've made no progress at all in defeating the bandits... Let us put the bandits aside for now. I want you to ask the townspeople what else is troubling them. If I can solve one of their problems, whatever it may be... Perhaps they will come to respect me a little. Well? Will you do it?","Good. Go into town and find out what troubles the people. If all goes well, I'll give you my prized treasure, the Sea Bell!","I see... You won't do it. I meant to give you a treasure, but so be it.","Will you hurry and find out what troubles the people?","Well? Have you decided to ask the people about their troubles?","Well? Did you find out what troubles the townspeople? What?! They're running short of well water? Hmm... Then I'll order more water to be sent down the waterway! Someone! Is anyone there?!","Kalkara Village manages the waterway, does it not? Go at once and tell the caretaker to open the floodgate wider!","Enough! I'll go to Kalkara and tell the caretaker myself!","It seems the town's water shortage has finally been resolved. Next, I must deal with the bandits... But for now, I seem to have regained a little of the people's trust. I must thank you for your help. As promised, I shall give you the Sea Bell. Let us go to the treasury.","The bandits' hideout is the Mirage Lake east of Assia! This time, I shall capture every last one of them! Who will join me in attacking their hideout?","Thank you for your courage! We must destroy the bandits at any cost!","I'm sorry, but the bandits have stolen the treasure I promised you. I'm going to the Mirage Lake to capture them! If I return safely, I'll give you the Sea Bell!","Those scoundrels! I'll teach them what happens when they lay hands on my treasure!","Ah, it's you! Welcome back! All the bandits have been captured... And the people have returned to their peaceful lives! You have done so much for us. You have my gratitude!","W-what's wrong?! What happened here?!","What?! Is that true? Grrr... Gather everyone in the castle in my chamber at once!"]}],"npc-king-of-greatlog":[{"place":"GreatLog Castle","passages":["Oh! Is that true?! To think Kameha has a friend! You appear to be a monster master. That would explain Kameha's interest in other worlds. But the real surprise is that he has a friend at all!","I hate to trouble you, but please look after Kameha.","Oh, yes! Let me give you this. It's called the Sky Key. It opens the way to another world.","Kameha took an identical one from the castle. I'm sure he'll cause you trouble, but I'm counting on you!","And while traveling to other worlds is all very well, let your family see you're safe now and then.","Oh! Kameha has returned safely from the other world. It's all thanks to you. I must reward you somehow... You may have what's in the treasure chest in my room. Please keep being Kameha's friend... With only adults around, the poor boy must be lonely.","There have been many earthquakes lately. I hope nothing happens... My people cannot live peacefully like this.","Welcome, everyone! Allow me to introduce... The hero who saved GreatLog, [your name]!","Though Kameha was responsible for the island sinking... Not one of us heeded your warning of the danger... Yet your actions moved all our hearts! [your name]! Words cannot express our gratitude! Now, forget all formalities today! Enjoy yourselves!","GreatLog is saved! We can all rest easy! GreatLog's navel is firmly plugged!","Why, it's [your name], the savior of GreatLog!","I hear Kameha is training hard to become a monster master. Please remain his friend... And a worthy rival."]},{"place":"GreatTree Castle","passages":["King of GreatTree, I look forward to Starry Night. Ha ha ha ha ha!","How do you fare, King of GreatTree? Has any master in GreatTree managed to clear Class S?","Oh! Is that so? I hadn't noticed! I took this child for a castle cleaner. You've heard the rumors about my kingdom's master. They are quite true. Our master is the strongest. Do try to avoid a humiliating defeat!","Heh heh, ha ha ha. I look forward to Starry Night! Ha ha ha ha ha!!"]}],"npc-king-of-greattree":[{"place":"GreatTree Castle","passages":["Welcome, new master! I am the king of GreatTree. What is your name?","Hmm, [your name], is it? I have a request for you straight away. Enter the tournament on Starry Night and win the championship!","What? You're not a master!? You came here while pursuing your kidnapped sister? What! You haven't come to hear my request? ...Hmm. Hmmmmmm.","But now, [your name], was it? Searching this vast world for your kidnapped sister would be no easy task. Let me tell you an easier way than searching!","Become a master and win the Starry Night tournament, of course!! Legend says that the winner can have any dream come true. Surely your dream of seeing your sister will come true as well! Hmm, I've tied that together rather neatly, if I do say so myself. In any case, the fact that Watabou brought you here... ...means you have the talent to be a master. Now! I shall give you a monster. You can't do a master's work without one! Go right from the castle entrance to reach the monster farm. Ask a fellow called Pulio there to give you a monster. Once you've received one, come back here.","Hmm, don't say that. It won't hurt to listen!","You can't do a master's work without a monster. Go right from the castle entrance to reach the monster farm. Ask a fellow called Pulio there to give you a monster. Once you've received one, come back here.","Ah! That monster belonged to the previous king...! [your name]! Why did you bring that monster!? Huh? It was the only one there? That wretched Pulio! He let the other monsters escape!! Pulio! Pulio! Someone bring Pulio here!","That Pulio! I cannot forgive him this time!","Pulio, you didn't let Healie escape too, did you!?","Grr! You let my precious Healie get away!! Unforgivable! Someone lock this fellow in jail!!","! What is it, [your name]!? Have you something to say!?","What? You'll catch Healie if I spare him? You say you'll bring Healie back yourself?","Interesting! [your name]! Go ahead and try.","I see. Then, [your name], go to the Departure Gate! Bring Healie back, and I shall pardon Pulio! You may take what you like from the treasure chests downstairs... Ask the minister for the details. I'm busy, so I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","No! Those eyes tell me you have something to say!","[your name]! Have you brought Healie back? What? Healie said he didn't want to come back here? ...But he said he'd follow you!? Oh... I see... Hmm! Winning a monster's affection is admirable! I like you! I shall pardon Pulio!","[your name], now go to the arena. Your rivals await you there. Defeat them all, and you can enter the tournament! Well, I'm busy, so I must take my leave. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated another monster! Heh heh, how was it? Did you find a girl you liked? No, no. Never mind. But you do have an eye for the ladies! No girl could resist you.","Keep training! I shall take my leave. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! I hear you've cleared Class G! Splendid! You're quite the... Oh!!","Grr! That king of GreatLog! Just you wait!! [your name]! Train harder than ever! As a reward, I shall open the Waiting and Guardian rooms! Stronger monsters dwell there. They will surely prove useful. As I am a busy man, I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Dragon! You're quite capable, despite appearances! Still, kidnapping a princess... That Dragon certainly has ambition! Left unchecked, it might have kidnapped every princess in the world.","Oh! Did I go a little too far? ...Keep up the good work, [your name]! Make good use of the storage service and the library! ...Now then, I'm busy, so I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Golem! Beating it with that tiny body... You're a little giant! Even the mighty Golem is no more than a pebble to you. You could juggle those Golem pebbles with one hand!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Demon Knight! Well done finding the Travelers' Gate where it dwells! You're as cunning as a demon yourself! Perhaps you could even steal a great demon lord's purse.","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Great Sabrecat! They say a Great Sabrecat is as swift as a gale. You must be as swift as a typhoon! When you run, nobody could possibly see you.","Oh, yes. Have you been breeding monsters at the Starry Shrine? They say the one who masters breeding comes closest to the championship. Apparently, repeated breeding makes stronger monsters. Well, I'm busy, so I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Treeface! They say Treefaces can cast curses. To repel even that curse... You're like a child of the gods! Oh! You're so dazzling I can barely see you!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Big Eye! What? The Big Eye didn't join you? I see... Well, that happens sometimes. I forgot to tell you, but you don't need meat for bosses. Those that will join you do so even without meat. Those that won't join simply won't. Knowing this will keep you from wasting meat... ...and you should save up a hundred thousand gold in no time! Ten million gold will be yours before you know it!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Fang Slime! Oh, you went to a casino? How much did you win? Monster gold? That's no use here! It seems you've been taken for a ride. Be careful, or they'll leave your very soul empty!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Gigantes! A Gigantes may be a little lacking in brains... ...but I've heard it has tremendous strength! To defeat one, you must have the strength of a million men! You might even lift the whole kingdom of GreatTree!","Oh, [your name]! Well done clearing Class D! I shall permit you to enter Class C and above! ...Or I'd like to, but actually, [your name]... Something is wrong with the gates in the Strength and Anger rooms. A terrifying number of monsters has apparently appeared!! As the host nation, we cannot overlook this. Would you go to the Strength and Anger rooms at once? I'm busy, so I must take my leave, but... ...please discover what's causing this strange occurrence! I'm counting on you, [your name]! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","[your name]! Visiting other gates is all very well... ...but hurry up and settle the disturbance at the Anger Gate!! ...Having said that, I'm busy, so I must take my leave. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]!! Welcome back! I've already heard of your efforts. Well done! !! ...Hmm!","Just you wait, DeadTree. This time, we shall win! ...[your name]. What an unwelcome interruption. But I'm glad you've returned! I hear you wiped out eggs as numerous as the stars in an instant. Just as I'd expect from [your name]. You do things on a grand scale! Now, [your name]! You may enter Class C and above. Clear Class S, and you'll represent our kingdom! I'm counting on you, [your name]! Well, I have work to do, so I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Living Statue! I hear those statues creep up silently from behind. What cowardly monsters! If you hadn't defeated it, I couldn't have slept in peace. I'd have had to hold it in rather than visit the privy at night.","...Hmm. Did I go too far? Well then, I'm busy, so I must take my leave. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Copycat! I hear it enjoys imitating all sorts of things. But it could never imitate my handsome looks! Even I sometimes fail to live up to myself!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Sky Dragon! I hear only someone very clever can even meet that monster. Just as I'd expect from [your name]. Your wisdom is godlike!! Could you unravel the mysteries of the universe for me?","Oh, yes, [your name]. Do you talk to the people of the kingdom sometimes? There's said to be a pleasant fellow in town called the Medal Man... He apparently loves tiny medals, so you should bring him some! Well, I'm busy, so I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Funky Bird! From now on, I'll call you Funky [your name]! When you dance, the whole kingdom will start dancing!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Dungeon Shrimp! What! You say you heard a voice from nowhere? Are you all right, [your name]? Did you hit your head somewhere? A bump would be one thing, but a crack in your skull would be serious!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated Jamiras! Thoroughly trounce every monster you find and make it obey you! Perhaps you'll become the king of monsters one day.","[your name], spending all your time with monsters isn't everything. Getting to know people is good, too! Well, I'm busy, so I must take my leave! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Demon Servant! What? You resisted its wicked temptations and defeated it? I see. Your heart's beauty is as dazzling as MegaMagic! Even the sun would look dim beside you!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated Orochi! That means you've collected 100 monster species? Just as I'd expect from [your name]! You're everything I'd hoped for. At this rate, I'd like you to collect another million species!!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated the Dark Horn! To find your way through that maze and defeat it... Your intuition strikes like Hellblast! You understand everything in a single flash of insight!","Oh, [your name]! You've defeated Akbar! You've committed no crime! There's nothing to worry about! If anyone complains, I'll throw them in jail! That's practically what the castle jail is for!","Oh, [your name]!! You're finally entering the Starry Night tournament! How long I've waited for this day! From now on, you may use every room in the Travelers' Gate Chamber... ...Oh!!","Don't mock us! As sneering as ever, aren't you! The master standing beside you is our representative!","Hmph! Let him talk! He doesn't know how strong [your name] is. ...Still, [your name], people do long to know the future... Naturally, I'm a little curious myself. ...You see, there is something called the Mirror Gate. They say you can meet your future self there. Would you meet your future self and find out? Whether you win the championship, or...! ...I'll say no more. Busy, busy, busy, busy...","[your name]! Well? What was your future like? What? You learned nothing about the Starry Night tournament?! Hmm... Hmmmm... No matter! You're sure to win! Starry Night will soon be here. Until then, you and your monsters should get some rest.","Ah, [your name]! Did you rest well? Tonight is Starry Night at last. Masters from other kingdoms are waiting eagerly at the arena! Go beat them so thoroughly they'll never get up again!","In any case! If you win, your dream should come true as well. Wasn't it to find your sister who was kidnapped?","Whatever it is, you've worked very hard to come this far! The people and I believe you will win. You are the one who will bring glory to GreatTree! We're counting on you, Master [your name]! May GreatTree's protection be with you! Now, I must attend to the tournament preparations! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Ah, yes. It was to return to your own world.","[your name]! Is that really you, [your name]?! Where on earth have you been? You vanished without warning! Oh, yes! These people have been waiting too!","I have prepared a reward for your victory. Go to the Travelers' Gate Chamber. New gates await you! Now, I must be going. I'm very busy. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Ah, [your name]! How admirable! Still working hard to find monsters, even after winning the tournament! [your name] is truly a model master! We should brew the dirt from [your name]'s fingernails and make everyone drink it, so they might learn from you!","No, I'm not exaggerating! I'd like to drink some myself! Well, that was an exaggeration. Ha ha ha ha! Now, I must be going. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Ah, [your name]! You defeated the Dragonlord!","To think you defeated a monster worthy of being called a demon lord...! I can no longer find words of praise grand enough for you. Why not take my place as king of this land? No! You could become king of the whole world! No, no! Perhaps you could even become a god!","Am I going too far? Hmm. Perhaps so. Ha ha ha ha! Keep up your training, [your name]! Now, I must be going. Busy, busy...busy, busy...","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Hargon!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Shido!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Baramos!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Zoma!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated DeathPsaro!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Estark!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Mildrath!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Mudo!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Deathmore! That is the strongest monster in the Travelers' Gates! Well done, [your name]! The greatest master in the universe! The next Starry Night is still a long, long way off... But we're counting on you next time too, [your name]! And don't forget the medals! Ha ha ha ha ha!","Ah, [your name]! You defeated Darkdrium! I hear that monster is a god of destruction feared even by demon lords... To think you defeated even that! I was right to put my faith in you! The next Starry Night is still a long, long way off... But now I look forward to the next tournament!"]},{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["Oh, [your name]! Well done winning the championship! Thanks to you, our kingdom's long-held wish has come true. You are a true master. The monster master of Starry Night! But what a shame, after you finally found your sister. Surely, if you wish upon the stars, you can meet her again...!","Oh! It's begun! Look at the sky!","I'm sure the stars will grant your wish! By the way, [your name], I have a suggestion. Why not stay here instead of returning to your own world? I and everyone in GreatTree have grown fond of you! We'd all be delighted if you stayed! Well? Will you keep living in GreatTree?","I thought not. Of course. You must find your sister... Forgive me for asking too much. Oh, yes! Why not go to the back of Starry Shrine? Only the champion is allowed to enter there. It's also the place where you first appeared. You may find an answer there!","Oh! You would stay in GreatTree?! But, [your name], hearing you say that is enough. I understand. You must go and find your sister, yes? Then why not go to the back of Starry Shrine? Only the champion is allowed to enter there. It's also the place where you first appeared. You may find an answer there!","[your name], go to the back of Starry Shrine! Only the champion is allowed to enter there. You may find an answer there!"]}],"npc-king-of-northden":[{"place":"Northden Castle · the impostor","passages":["Soldiers of Northden, listen well! I have decided to strengthen our army for the coming war with the western country. We must defend our families from those westerners who would steal our gold! In the name of the king of Northden, I command you to restore order to the border!","Who are you? I told the guards not to let anyone through. ...Hmph! The spirit's envoy? What foolishness is this? Very well. I shall at least explain the situation to you. Our kingdom was the first to lay claim to the gold vein in the border mine. I will never allow the western country to arrive later and claim our gold! In any case, the border must remain closed until the conflict ends!","I have nothing more to say to you. Leave at once.","What? You again!? Don't tell me you're claiming there's no gold in the mine too! Have those westerners tricked you into coming here to tell me what to do!?","You're no envoy of the spirit! You're a spy from the western country! You can rot in the dungeon!","Why do you keep questioning me!? Do you doubt me, ook...? Blast! I let an 'ook' slip!","...Curse you! My master ordered me to impersonate the king and start a conflict... You've ruined everything! You'll pay for this! Eek eek!"]},{"place":"Northden Castle · the two claimants","passages":["I am the real king! You impostor!","Wh-what are you talking about, impostor? I am the real king!","I am the real king! Surely you believe me?","Look into my eyes! Are these the eyes of a liar!?","You'll never grow into a respectable adult if you can't recognize the truth!","I must save this kingdom from that man! Believe me!","I am the true king! Don't believe him!","My regal bearing proves I am the true king! Just compare it with his!","Look how filthy he is! Quite different from me."]},{"place":"Northden Castle","passages":["Eeeek! A m-m-m-monster was pretending to be me!?","Splendid! Splendid! You saved me! Well done, believing in me and recognizing the true king of Northden! You may be a child, but you are surely a true hero! I have long awaited the arrival of a hero like you! ...What? You're not a hero? You're a monster master!? Bah! Don't fuss over such trifles! If you have courage, why can't a monster master be a hero too?","Ah, you there! Go and tell everyone that the real king has returned!","You've worked hard today. Stay at the castle and get some well-earned rest.","Did you sleep well, brave [your name]? To think the child who saved me was the spirit's envoy... All those million prayers I offered the spirit every day finally paid off!","Perhaps that was a slight exaggeration... Still, I'm glad we're safe! But that false king was every bit the monster he looked! Stirring up conflict between our kingdoms over gold that didn't even exist! As things stand, the western country may still attack us. Would you go there and clear up this misunderstanding?","I shall tell the soldiers to let you through... But there is probably still confusion at the border mine. I think the quickest way to the western country is to cross the sea from Nofo.","Ah, true hero [your name]! You look as idle as ever. Ha ha! Just a little joke. Pay it no mind! ...Hmm, I see. So that's what happened in the western country.","Every kingdom seems to be having a difficult time.","Still, you may do as you please in this kingdom!","From now on, you may use our item shops and inns as much as you like!","...Perhaps I went a little too far. Well, make yourself at home!","At least take some time to relax in our kingdom!","Ah, [your name]! Is your journey going well?","Ah, our savior, [your name]! Haven't you grown a little taller? Ha ha! Perhaps that hardly matters. Pay it no mind! Thanks to the spirit, we survived that bitter cold! [your name], would you thank the spirit on everyone's behalf? Be sure to offer thanks separately for every single person, understood!?","There's been far too much exaggeration lately! It's becoming a problem! From the minister, I mean. Not from me.","Ah, the famous [your name]! Still traveling without getting tired of it, I hear! Ha ha! Perhaps traveling is a fine thing after all. Pay it no mind! ...Hmm, I see. So that's what's happening in the eastern country.","From this day on, [your name] shall be the minister of Northden! That old fossil is no use to me anymore."]},{"place":"Border Mine","passages":["It's been a long time, King of the West!","We both have. Even if monsters were exploiting us... We nearly did something that could never be undone!","King of the West, you're as gloomy as ever! [your name] surely doesn't hold any of that against you!","There you go again, being gloomy! Why don't we mine it together? If we find gold, the north and west can split it!","And let us work together on more than just the mine! Is there anything wrong with that?!"]}],"npc-king-of-westernia":[{"place":"Westernia Castle","passages":["Y-Yuna? Why are you here? Weren't you supposed to remain asleep until we defeated the northern king...?","...The fortune-teller! Bring the fortune-teller from the castle!","W-what!? That's nothing like the story I was told!","Y-yes, you're right. But will the northern kingdom listen to us...?","Wh-who are you!? I seem to remember seeing you somewhere...","Oh! This child saved Yuna! I must offer a reward... ...Hm? Never mind a reward, you want me to listen? Of course. Tell me anything.","Enough... I've seen your dance. You may go!","You dare call Yuna a doll?! My dear granddaughter... I trust you're prepared to answer for those words! Guards! Take this brat to the dungeon!","Curse him... He got away. What a nimble little brat!","Yuna... Pay no heed to the words of such a fool.","...Very well. Next! Step forward!","I am the king of this land! Now, what have you to show me?","Oh? Then what exactly have you come to show me?","Grrr... So the northern kingdom is behind this! They dared to curse Yuna! I will tolerate no more! This means war! Prepare for battle!","Enough! I will hear no more! Hold your tongue! I shall restore Yuna's health, whatever it takes!","Fortune-teller, will you lend me your aid?","We shall soon leave for the mine on the border. We will crush the northern kingdom in a single blow!","Ah, messenger of the spirit! Welcome. Now that Yuna is herself again, the whole castle has come to life. The people truly adore her. I look forward to her future!"]},{"place":"Border Mine","passages":["...Indeed it has, King of the North. ...I've caused you a great deal of trouble.","...My love for my granddaughter clouded my judgment. Without [your name]...","...By the way, King of the North. About the mine. I intend to withdraw our claim and leave it to your kingdom. Our scholars say there is still gold sleeping within.","...Agreed! You're quite right, King of the North!"]}],"npc-machiko":[{"place":"GreatTree arena district","passages":["Machiko","Nice to meet you. I'm Machiko. To mark our new friendship... Want to breed a monster with my Wyvern?","Let me know whenever you want to breed our monsters! My Wyvern likes Bird-family monsters!","Well? Want to breed a monster with my Wyvern?","Which monster will you breed with Wyvern?","I have no idea what kind of egg we'll get... Well, shall we begin the breeding session?","I hope a strong monster is born! I'll send the egg to the farm.","I try to pick up every item I find on the ground... And for some reason, I often meet priests. Was that little story useful at all? I look forward to the day we can battle!","I try to pick up every item I find on the ground... And for some reason, I often meet priests. Was that little story useful at all? Hurry up and become a master who can beat me!","I lost. Completely! Your strength is the real thing! I like you, so I'm giving you one of my monsters! It's a Living Statue. You'll accept it, won't you?","I'll send Living Statue to the farm. Take good care of my Living Statue!","Oh... You already have too many monsters. Could you make some room and come see me again?","I see. Come see me if you change your mind.","My Living Statue can use Puff-puff! Even male monsters can use Puff-puff. A little strange, isn't it? Class S is full of strong opponents. Good luck, [your name]!","[your name], here's a useful tip. What happens if you breed a Demon-family monster with one carrying a big hammer...?","[your name], here's something you should know. A terrifying master is entering the tournament! Be careful! They say this master is merciless!","Doesn't Divine Dragon remind you of something? Yes. That monster that used to fly over the farm. Could there be a connection?"]},{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["Congratulations! That's our [your name]! From now on, everyone will aspire to be like you."]}],"npc-medal-collector":[{"place":"Medal Collector’s Room","passages":["I'm the Medal Collector. I collect tiny medals. I moved to GreatLog recently. I seek the tiny medals scattered all over the world. If you find any, would you bring them here? I'll give you nice things according to how many medals you bring.","I'm the Medal Collector. I collect tiny medals.","My goodness! So small, yet you saved GreatLog! I thought you were different. You're quite capable indeed. I'm expecting great things from your medal collecting too!"]},{"place":"Tiny medal rewards","passages":["[your name], your total is […] medals.","Well done, [your name]! […] medals! Your reward is […]!","[your name], I now hold […] of your medals.","When you reach […], I'll give you […]. Keep collecting!","I'll send the egg to your farm.","[your name]! Well done collecting […] medals! That's the last of my gifts. From now on, trade your medals for the rewards you want. I'll deduct the medals already used for rewards. I'm rooting for you! Keep it up!","Ah, [your name]! Here for your reward? Here, take […]!","...But your bag is full!","...But your farm is full!","I'll keep it. Make room at the farm.","I'm rooting for you! Keep collecting!","I'll keep it. Make room in your bag."]}],"npc-medal-man":[{"place":"Medal Man’s Room","passages":["Oh, welcome, mas... Ahem! I'm the Medal Man. I collect the tiny medals scattered throughout the world. If you find any medals, would you give them to me? I'll reward you according to how many you bring! I'm counting on you! Busy, busy...busy, busy...","I'm the man who collects tiny medals from all over the world."]},{"place":"Tiny medal rewards","passages":["[your name], your total is […] medals.","Well done, [your name]! […] medals! Your reward is […]!","[your name], I now hold […] of your medals.","When you reach […], I'll give you […]. Keep collecting!","I'll send the egg to your farm.","[your name]! Well done collecting […] medals! That's the last of my gifts. From now on, trade your medals for the rewards you want. I'll deduct the medals already used for rewards. I'm rooting for you! Keep it up!","Ah, [your name]! Here for your reward? Here, take […]!","...But your bag is full!","...But your farm is full!","I'll keep it. Make room at the farm.","I'm rooting for you! Keep collecting!","I'll keep it. Make room in your bag."]}],"npc-milly":[{"place":"Your Room · opening","passages":["[your name]! I said wait! It's bedtime! Have you forgotten what Mum and Dad said? Monsters carry off naughty children who stay up late...","See? Monsters really do exist!","What? You want to meet a monster? Don't be silly! Go to bed, now!","Good night, [your name].","... Zzz...","Hey! What are you doing?! Let go of me!","Aaaah! [your name]!!"]},{"place":"Your Room · returning home","passages":["Yaaawn... I must have been fast asleep... Oh? [your name], how long have you been awake? You shouldn't be up. Look how late it still is. They say monsters come to take away children who wander around at night... Come on, let's get some more sleep. ... ... ...","But it was so close! I almost won. Huh? What am I talking about? My dream, [your name]. We fought each other in my dream! What? [your name], you had the very same dream? You mean it wasn't a dream? We really fought each other?!","Yes... It does feel as if we really fought... But it was still a dream. We met in our dreams...","Come on, let's get some more sleep.","Good night, [your name]! Sweet dreams!","Yes... It really was a lovely dream!","Good night, [your name]! You can carry on dreaming in bed!","...Oh? [your name]!!","Your pocket's bulging. Is there something in it?"]},{"place":"GreatLog arena district","passages":["Well? Would you like to test your skills against me? If you beat me, you'll be the strongest master in GreatLog!","That's the spirit! Let's head straight to the ring. Sorry, but I won't be holding back!","All right! Then I won't hold back!","Oh... How boring. Come back if you change your mind.","I hate to admit it, but you win. That was a good match... New masters have been growing stronger while I was away.","I'd better get back to training too! Let's head back.","Phew! That was a good match. You're pretty strong! New masters have been growing stronger while I was away.","I really want to enter the next Starry Night Tournament! I lost to my little brother Terry in the last tournament's final! This time, I'm determined to beat him soundly. But first, I'll have to beat you to become our representative. Here's to our rivalry! Let's both train hard!","You've got quite a fighting spirit, challenging me again! But I'll give it my all too! Is that all right?"]},{"place":"GreatTree arena · Starry Night Tournament","passages":["N-no... It can't be... [your name]? H-how? I see... You were brought here, just like me... They brought me to the kingdom of GreatLog. The king and the others told me to become a master. They said I couldn't return to our world unless I won... I had no choice. I became a master and worked hard. Then, one day, I heard a rumor from GreatTree. About a little master who was improving incredibly fast. I never imagined it was you, [your name]... But we've both come this far. Neither of us can back down now. Here I come, [your name]! Let's celebrate our reunion with a match!","[your name], you're going to challenge me again? That's my [your name]! Still as determined as ever. Here I come, [your name]! A match to celebrate our reunion!","[your name]! You were so strong!"]},{"place":"Queen's Room","passages":["[your name], how are you? I was chatting with the queen. Apparently, there are still lots of monsters we don't know about! I'm going to look for them. Oh, [your name]! Shall we breed our monsters? Let's breed one of yours with my Skeleton Swordsman!","Come see me again when you want to breed our monsters.","Let's breed one of your monsters with my Skeleton Swordsman!","Which monster will you breed with Skeleton Swordsman?","I have no idea what kind of egg we'll get... Well, shall we begin the breeding session?","I hope a strong monster is born! I'll send the egg to the farm!","I'm going to look for even more amazing monsters! Apparently, there are monsters somewhere that don't belong to any family!","Have you gotten a monster from the ???? family yet? I hear some monsters change their appearance when bred with one! I don't know which monsters you need to breed, though.","Low-level monsters can't breed!","That would leave you with no monsters to take along!","Shall we start the breeding session?","Monsters that are away adventuring can't breed!"]}],"npc-monster-elder":[{"place":"Starry Shrine","passages":["Oh, it's been a while! Do you remember me? I'm the old man who took you to the castle when you first came to GreatTree. People call me the Monster Elder. This is the Starry Shrine, where monsters are bred and hatched. Breeding means marrying one monster to another. When they marry, they produce an egg. Hatching means bringing a monster out of that egg. ...What brings you here today?","Welcome to the Starry Shrine. What brings you here today?","Watabou once brought me to this world, too. I became a master and won the tournament. The spirit of GreatTree born on that Starry Night... ...must be raising a new GreatTree sapling somewhere by now. Eventually that sapling will grow into a great tree. A huge, huge tree, just like this kingdom!","Well, putting that aside... What will you do today?","Ho ho ho! I've come out of retirement! You're still green, youngster. You'll have to get stronger!","You... There's nothing more I can teach you. You've grown wonderfully. You and your monsters alike...! All that's left is to befriend every monster... But the road will be a hard one. There are 312 species in all. I never managed it myself..."]},{"place":"Breeding and hatching","passages":["Which monster will be the pedigree?","Make […]+[…]?","Which monster will be its mate?","[…]+[…] should be born!","You have befriended that kind of monster before.","You have never befriended that kind of monster before!","Hatching costs […]G. Shall I hatch it?","You want it hatched too. Very well, wait a moment!","You do not need it hatched. Very well, wait a moment!","You do not have enough gold. I will just breed them, then.","My word! I sense that a remarkable monster will be born!","I have sent the new egg to the farm.","Is there anything else you need?","That monster's level is too low to breed. Bring it back at level 10 or above.","Which egg shall I hatch?","Are you sure you want that egg?","I will send the equipped accessory to storage.","Will you take […] with you now?","Raise it with care.","I will send […] to the farm, then.","Even I cannot tell what kind of monster will be born... Hatching costs […]G. Shall I hatch it too?","You do not have enough gold. I am afraid I cannot hatch it.","Very well, wait a moment. I will hatch it right away.","You cannot take any more with you. Which one will you leave behind?","Strive to become a true monster master!","Name […][…] […]?","That would leave no monsters in your party!","I am afraid there is no mate available...","...But your storage is full! Make some room in storage, then come back.","You have no eggs!","That monster went adventuring and has not returned!","I will return the equipped accessory to you.","Your inventory is full. I will send the equipped accessory to storage.","Your inventory and storage are full. I cannot return the accessory. Choose a monster with no accessory equipped.","Please choose its name carefully.","You already have a monster with that name.","You have too few monsters to breed!","You cannot breed monsters of the same sex!","Are you sure that is what you want?"]}],"npc-monster-professor":[{"place":"Starry Shrine","passages":["Welcome to the Starry Shrine. I am the Monster Professor... I look after this shrine and study monsters. Here, you can breed monsters by having them marry. I can also hatch the eggs produced through breeding.","Now... What brings you here today?","Welcome to the Starry Shrine. What brings you here today?","Hm?! Aren't you the hero who saved GreatLog?! Well... Did breeding help you on your travels?"]},{"place":"Breeding and hatching","passages":["Which monster will be the pedigree?","Make […]+[…]?","Which monster will be its mate?","[…]+[…] should be born!","You have befriended that kind of monster before.","You have never befriended that kind of monster before!","Hatching costs […]G. Shall I hatch it?","You want it hatched too. Very well, wait a moment!","You do not need it hatched. Very well, wait a moment!","You do not have enough gold. I will just breed them, then.","My word! I sense that a remarkable monster will be born!","I have sent the new egg to the farm.","Is there anything else you need?","That monster's level is too low to breed. Bring it back at level 10 or above.","Which egg shall I hatch?","Are you sure you want that egg?","I will send the equipped accessory to storage.","Will you take […] with you now?","Raise it with care.","I will send […] to the farm, then.","Even I cannot tell what kind of monster will be born... Hatching costs […]G. Shall I hatch it too?","You do not have enough gold. I am afraid I cannot hatch it.","Very well, wait a moment. I will hatch it right away.","You cannot take any more with you. Which one will you leave behind?","Strive to become a true monster master!","Name […][…] […]?","That would leave no monsters in your party!","I am afraid there is no mate available...","...But your storage is full! Make some room in storage, then come back.","You have no eggs!","That monster went adventuring and has not returned!","I will return the equipped accessory to you.","Your inventory is full. I will send the equipped accessory to storage.","Your inventory and storage are full. I cannot return the accessory. Choose a monster with no accessory equipped.","Please choose its name carefully.","You already have a monster with that name.","You have too few monsters to breed!","You cannot breed monsters of the same sex!","Are you sure that is what you want?"]}],"npc-mother":[{"place":"Home in GreatLog","passages":["Oh, [your name]. You've come at just the right time. Sorry, but I'd like you to run a little errand. Grandma made your favorite nut pie. It's arrived at the storage service! I'm busy unpacking. Could you two go and get it?","Thank you. The storage service is west of the farm. Don't be too late. Take care!","Please pick up the nut pie from the storage service. The pie Grandma made has arrived there. It's west of the farm. Don't be too late. Oh, there's one thing I forgot to tell you. Your father treasures the pot in the back... So don't play with it!","Oh, [your name]. Did you finish the errand?","And where has your brother gone?","And where has Tara gone?","Welcome home, you two. Did you find the storage service without getting lost?","Oh, you're both so dirty. Did something happen? ...?! Hee hee... Has Warubou been fooling you? Don't worry. The island won't sink that easily.","Let's all eat the nut pie together when your father finishes work. Go and play outside a little longer. Oh, yes... I know I've said it before, but don't play with the pot in the back!","Oh, going out to play? Be careful not to get hurt. If you do, use this right away.","Another lovely day. Perfect for doing the laundry. Don't stay cooped up on a day like this. Go out and play.","You've been going out a lot lately. Where do you play? ...What? You're on a journey to save GreatLog?! Hee hee... Then perhaps I can ask our brave hero to run an errand. Could you buy some Amor Water at the item shop? The poor Drake Slime has a terrible sunburn. Here. You may keep the change as your reward.","Please buy some Amor Water at the item shop.","Oh! You bought the Amor Water! Now we can treat the Drake Slime's burns. Thank you!","Perhaps I'll ask you to run errands now and then. Hee hee... No need to look so unhappy about it.","Oh, [your name], welcome home. Tired of playing already? If you don't mind, could you run another errand?","Hee hee, that's unusual. I hope it doesn't rain... Then... Could you buy some Magic Water? Your father seems worn out from working so hard.","Hee hee, of course not. All right, off you go and play.","Please buy some Magic Water at the item shop.","Oh, you found it! That's a big help. Thank you!","Then... Could you buy some rib? You must be tired of eating fish every day.","Please buy some rib at the item shop.","It's been such a help having [your name] lend a hand so often lately.","Another beautiful day. Such a lovely blue sky. Why not go and play by the sea today, [your name]?","I was going to ask Cobi, but [your name] will do!","There's something I'd like you to find... Could you do that for me?","The farm your father dreamed of is complete, so I'd like to celebrate. I need sirloin for the feast. Please get some for me.","I see... All right, then. I'll ask Cobi.","I was going to ask Tara, but [your name] will do!","I see... All right, then. I'll ask Tara.","Please buy some sirloin at the item shop.","They don't sell it nearby. Well done finding some!","I don't need anything right now. I'll ask you another time... [your name].","[your name]...There have been so many earthquakes in GreatLog lately. Could they be a sign of something...? Don't wander too far.","Oh, another lovely day. Whether you're going out to play... Or to save another world, just be careful not to get hurt. Promise your mother! All right?!"]}],"npc-mud-hand-s-room-rock-paper-scissors-opponent":[{"place":"Mud Hand’s Room","passages":["What, you haven't even beaten my brother yet! I have no use for weaklings. Come back when you're stronger!","Want to take me on at rock-paper-scissors?","Aw, you're no fun.","All right! Here goes! Rock...paper...","Go see my brother! Something good is waiting for you!","Rock-paper-scissors is my life! Let's play! Rock...paper..."]}],"npc-petitbou":[{"place":"Beneath GreatLog Castle","passages":["Who's this little squirt? Are you really a monster master?","Dad said so, so I'll tag along with you.","Dad said so, so I'll look after you from now on.","Staying here guarding GreatLog's belly button... It's kinda boring. Maybe I'll pull it out! ...I'm kidding! Sheesh, don't make that scary face.","You're back, [your name]! I'll share GreatLog's power with you!","There, all better! Be careful out there!","Hey, [your name]! Getting beaten? What a weakling! You're not much of a hero, are you? But I'm generous, so I'll share GreatLog's power with you!"]}],"npc-pulio":[{"place":"GreatTree Castle","passages":["Y-Your Majesty! Please forgive me!","Forgive me, Your Majesty! Healie ran away too!","Your Majesty! Healie went through the Departure Gate!","[your name]! I'm sorry you're doing all this for me... Oh, right! Let me tell you something useful. You can save your adventure through Tactics on the main menu!","Thank you, [your name]! Now I can go back to the farm!!"]},{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["I'm Pulio. I look after this farm. The king told me about you. Go ahead and take a monster. Though all we've got right now is one old monster.","But he's Surabou, a monster the previous king treasured! All right, Surabou! Your new master's come for you! Go out there and do your best!","Surabou's sure to be a great help to you, [your name]! And he's happy he can go adventuring again!","Thanks, [your name]! You really helped me out! Here's a tip to thank you. A Sky Dragon flies above the farm... Wait underneath it, and something good is bound to happen eventually! I'll work hard on the farm for you too, [your name]! Choose Form Party to take monsters with you.","If you hadn't helped me back then, [your name]... I wouldn't have been able to keep looking after this farm. Thank you, [your name]. Congratulations on winning! Let's be friends forever and ever!","Where were you? You vanished so suddenly, I was worried! All your monsters missed you too, [your name]. Hurry and show them you're all right!"]},{"place":"Managing the GreatTree farm","passages":["Welcome! What are we doing today?","What else will you do?","Who will you release?","You'll never see it again. Release it?","Its equipped accessory will be lost too. Is that all right?","Which will you release?","Come visit again! Everyone's waiting for you, [your name]!","You keep the accessory, [your name].","...But your inventory's full. I'll send it to storage.","...But your inventory and storage are full. Sell or discard some items, then come back.","Which egg will you release into the wild?","There are no monsters at the farm!","There are no eggs at the farm!","You'll have no monsters left!","That monster's adventuring online. You can't take it along.","Releasing it would leave no monsters in your party!","Your monsters look happy to travel with you, [your name]."]}],"npc-queen-of-eastoria":[{"place":"Eastoria","passages":["Oh... Could you be...? Are you the hero who ended the conflict between the northern and western kingdoms? I thought so. The king of the north told me about you. Welcome to the eastern kingdom. I am its queen. Recently, everyone in our kingdom lost their voices... But we already have a suspect, and I have sent people from the castle to investigate. There should be no need to trouble you with this matter.","There should be no need to trouble you with this incident.","In the end, we did need your help after all. This must stay between us, but I have the power to see the future in my dreams. One day, I had a terrible dream of the northern and western kingdoms at war. I was about to send messengers to both kingdoms to warn them... When my voice... No, the voices of everyone in this kingdom were stolen. It was probably the work of whoever wanted those two kingdoms to fight. But you were the one who brought that conflict to an end. Thank you, young hero, for saving my kingdom as well.","I believe that wizard was merely being used. Still, there is no doubt he harbored wicked intentions. We should have no more incidents like this."]}],"npc-queen-of-greattree":[{"place":"Queen’s Room","passages":["I am the queen of GreatTree, a lover of combat. But it appears you have yet to visit Starry Shrine. Return another time. I have no interest in the weak.","I am the queen of GreatTree. Would you grant me a request? I simply must see a monster called a Winged Slime. Please show me this Slime with wings like a bird!","Oh! A Winged Slime! How adorable!","Well done bringing it here! I shall reward you!","But it seems you cannot carry any more items. Make some room, then return.","[…]. Use it wisely.","I wish to reward you, but your inventory is full. Hurry and make some room.","Now, hear my next request. […] is what I wish to see!","A King Slime, which looks as though Slimes have joined together!","Oh! A King Slime! How wonderfully plump and bouncy!","A Florajay, which resembles a flower yet has wings!","Oh! A Florajay! What an amusing face!","A Cursed Lamp, said to hold the curse of a flying tree!","Oh! A Cursed Lamp! What a mean-looking face!","I am satisfied. Come again when you have grown stronger.","A Metal Slime, so hard and shiny!","Oh! A Metal Slime! How very shiny!","I hear Killer Ape is a great ape of the Beast family.","Oh! A Killer Ape! What a strong-looking ape!","A Horn Beetle, which looks like a stag beetle with a horn!","Oh! A Horn Beetle! What a magnificent horn!","Now, hear my next request. I wish to see a Reaper! A Reaper, said to carry a great scythe for taking heads!","Oh! A Reaper! What a sharp-looking scythe!","Now, hear my next request. I wish to see a Firebird! A Firebird, said to have a Slime with wings and a tail as a parent!","Oh! A Firebird! It resembles a Blizzard Hawk.","I am satisfied. [your name], win the championship!","Your sister Milly is here for a visit... What a charming girl she is! Seeing my husband's happy face on Starry Night... Made me realize I should return to the castle once in a while.","Lately, I've been thinking I should return to the castle now and then... But first, I wish to see a Wight King! Being of the Zombie family, I hear its appearance is truly terrifying...","Oh! A Wight King! How sorrowful it looks...","Show me a King Leo, said to be the beast among beasts!","Oh! A King Leo! Such dignity, just as I expected.","A Rainbow Peacock, said to be born when flame melts ice!","Oh! A Rainbow Peacock! What beautiful wings!","An Armored Scorpion, said to be the strongest of the Bug family!","Oh! An Armored Scorpion! What a fearsome tail!","I'd like to touch those writhing tendrils just once!","Oh! A Rose Battler! How wonderfully it wriggles!","A Golden Golem, said to be the finest of all Material monsters!","Oh! A Golden Golem! Its gold almost dazzles my eyes!","The dragon among dragons, imbued with divine power!","Oh! A Divine Dragon! What a noble appearance!","[your name], I am satisfied from the bottom of my heart. Surely there is no other master in the world to rival you! Perhaps it is time I returned to the castle."]}],"npc-queen-of-the-mermaids":[{"place":"Mermaid Kingdom","passages":["...Welcome. I am the queen of the mermaids. Why you have come here, and what it is you seek... I believe I understand.","Child of humanity... You are the one who should leave. The treasure you seek, the Mirror of Destruction, is not here. Even if we had it, I would never give it to you.","You who follow an evil master! Come to your senses!","We do not seek conflict, but we will fight to protect our people. If you leave now, no one need be hurt...","If you search north of Yord Village, I believe you will find their ship.","The ghost ship is all that remains of the pirates who sank beneath the sea. Unable to let go of their treasure, they continue to drift upon the waves.","Welcome, young hero! I can think of nothing to say but thank you.","Please accept this ring as a token of our gratitude.","It was found aboard a ship that sank to the seabed. It should be returned to human hands.","...Or so I intended, but it seems your belongings are full. I'll keep it for you until you've made room.","Welcome, young hero! We are inviting humans into our kingdom to strengthen our friendship."]}],"npc-sanchi":[{"place":"GreatTree","passages":["That's right. It's Sanchi. You figured it out. Hmph... Follow me!","Wait here!","Go talk to my grandpa!!","Hurry up and talk to my grandpa!","You talked to my grandpa, then. Then hurry up and use the Travelers' Gate!","Go use the Travelers' Gate already, you idiot!!","The Travelers' Gate... Was it...useful...?","Y-you idiot!","I...I'm glad. ... Blush."]}],"npc-slash":[{"place":"GreatLog farm","passages":["Hey! That was a long voyage, wasn't it? I'm Slash! I'm the slime who keeps the monsters on this farm together. To put it simply, I'm the leader here.","If you have any trouble, come talk to me!","If you two know, could you tell us what happened?","...I see. All right. We'll leave it to you. If you need our help, just say the word!","The island's sinking? We're in real trouble! If you need my help, just say the word!","Hey, you two! Why the long faces? Sorry to eavesdrop, but I heard everything. In that case, I'll go to the other world with you. If one of you stays behind, that settles it, right?","Yeah, with you, [your name], I think we could make a good team!","All right! We leave tomorrow morning! Get a good rest today!"]},{"place":"Magic Door Shrine","passages":["Ow! That jerk! What an unpleasant fellow! Oh, well. Come on, [your name]. Let's keep moving."]}],"npc-surabou":[{"place":"Pulio at the GreatTree farm","passages":["But he's Surabou, a monster the previous king treasured! All right, Surabou! Your new master's come for you! Go out there and do your best!","Surabou's sure to be a great help to you, [your name]! And he's happy he can go adventuring again!"]}],"npc-surao":[{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["I'm Surao. Old Surabou is my grandfather.","You can leave up to 30 monsters and eggs here. Monsters gain experience even while they're on the farm. But they get less than when you take them with you.","Raise some strong monsters!","Want to know about the farm?","[your name]! I have a favor to ask! I want to travel with a master like you, [your name]. Let me join you! Please!","I guess there's no point recruiting a Slime this late... But talk to me if you change your mind.","[your name]... You already have too many monsters. Make some room, then talk to me again!","Thank you, [your name]! I'll wait on the farm!","[your name]! Will you let me join you?","[your name]! Congratulations on winning! Grandpa Surabou must be happy too!","You came back to GreatTree!","I'd be happy if you stayed here forever."]}],"npc-tara":[{"place":"Aboard the sailing ship","passages":["Hey! I told you not to get in the way of their work! Ah! Wait a minute!","The monsters seem so excited about their first voyage. But if they cause too much trouble, Dad's going to scold me. I wish they'd settle down a little...","...You're right. I'm getting pretty tired of it too... Sea yesterday, sea today. It feels like we haven't moved at all!","Oh, big brother! Dad was looking for you! He couldn't find you anywhere and thought you might be asleep among the luggage... He was really worried. You'd better go and see him.","Come on, big brother! Hurry, or you'll get scolded!","Big brother! They say we'll be able to see GreatLog soon!","Hey, big brother! Let's go up to the lookout!","That's GreatLog! I can see a huge palm tree! There's no way we could climb a tree that tall, is there?! Even if we did, getting down would be hard!","I wonder what GreatLog is like... I can't wait to see what our new life will be like! Let's go out and explore as soon as we arrive, big brother!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Castle","passages":["Congratulations, big brother! You finally did it! It was lonely when no one believed us... But we all worked together and saved GreatLog! ...Oh? What's wrong? You look a little down... I see... Traveling with your monster friends... And meeting all sorts of people in new worlds... You'd come to really enjoy it, so you're a little sad it's over, right?"]},{"place":"Beneath GreatLog Castle","passages":["I told you, that's ours!","How dare you! Give back our nut pie!","This is terrible! GreatLog is going to sink! Do we have anything at home that could replace the navel...? Oh, I know! big brother, what about that? Let's go home. We have to bring it here!","...What do we do? This is serious! Let's go home and talk it over!"]},{"place":"GreatLog farm","passages":["I told you, it's not mealtime yet! You'll get fat!","Hee hee, we got told off. Let's go see Mom, big brother.","Hmm... Maybe you could become one, big brother. Hee hee.","Everyone... Don't panic! This island is going to sink soon!","But we'll do something about it, so it'll be fine! Right, big brother?","Why won't you believe us?! ...You're so stubborn, Dad!","That spirit said the island will sink if we don't do something!","I'm helping Dad look after the monsters. You can leave monsters here or take them with you. Big brother! Are you taking any friends today, or leaving some here?","Hey, big brother! Have you found a replacement navel? ...Oh, the Sea Bell didn't work. But I'm sure you'll find something. Keep trying, big brother! Oh, Dad and I made the farm a little bigger. We can look after a few more monsters now!","Big brother! Are you taking any friends today, or leaving some here?","Hey, big brother! Tell me about your adventures!","...Oh, so Prince Kameha is looking for a replacement navel too. By the way, the bridge to the island next to the farm is finished. We can look after a few more monsters now!","Hey, big brother! Isn't it great that GreatLog's back to normal? Now, instead of searching for a navel, let's try collecting monsters! It'll be fun to make friends with lots of different monsters! Oh, the barn on the island next to the farm is finished... So you can put monsters into hibernation now!","...A Demon Lord who's a collector?! What a strange Demon Lord... We've been having earthquakes every day lately... Everyone's saying GreatLog is going to sink.","At first, I was jealous of you, big brother... But lately, I've started enjoying the work here too. The more love you give the monsters, the more they give back.","Welcome home, big brother. What'll you do today?","It'll be fine, Mom! I'll be with him. We'll be right back, so get the tea ready!","That's it! This pot should fit that hole perfectly! Let's sneak it out without Mom seeing.","Wait, big brother. What about a replacement for the navel? If we don't bring one soon, something terrible will happen.","If we don't find a replacement for GreatLog's navel... This house, the farm, and the whole island will sink. We've both got to go to the other world and look, right?","But if we both go, Mom will worry.","...You're right. If we both go, Mom will worry.","...Big brother, you look really eager to go.","Then I'll leave this to you! Do your best!","Good morning, big brother. That nut pie was delicious! Good luck in the other worlds. Leave things here to me!","Dad! Our farm's almost finished! I'm getting to know everyone here better too!","At first, I was really worried about how things would go... But you're doing even better than I expected, big brother! If you get bored of being a master, I'll trade places with you anytime. ...Not that that'll happen, right? Hee hee...","Come on, let's eat too! Mom's lovely cooking will get cold. Let's dig in!"]},{"place":"GreatLog","passages":["What's wrong, big brother? ...Wait, where's the nut pie? Don't tell me those two took it! They'll pay for this!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Main Street","passages":["Now I'm angry! Give it back!"]},{"place":"Managing the GreatLog farm","passages":["Welcome home, big brother! What shall we do today?","Anything else to do?","Who will you release?","You'll never see it again. Release it?","Its accessory will be lost too. Release it anyway?","Which will you release?","Tell me your best adventure story next time!","Keep its accessory, big brother.","...But your inventory is full. I'll send it to storage for you.","...But your inventory and storage are full. Make room in either one and come back.","Which egg will you release?","Silly! There are no monsters at the farm!","Silly! There are no eggs at the farm!","You'll have no monsters left!","Silly! That monster is adventuring online!","Releasing it would leave no monsters in your party!","Your monsters look happy to travel with you, big brother."]}],"npc-terry":[{"place":"GreatLog arena district","passages":["I heard there was someone incredible here, so I came to GreatLog to see...","But with so few monsters, it can't be you.","Heh... I'm Terry, a monster master from GreatTree.","Could it be you? I can't tell just by looking... A battle would settle it. How about a match?","Heh... You look confident. Just so you know... Once we start, there's no calling it off! See you in the ring.","Show me what you can really do!","So I've got the wrong person... Guess I can't trust my instincts. I heard it was the one who saved GreatLog. I had high hopes.","It must be you! Isn't it? Well, a battle will tell. Come on, let's do this!","I've still got a long way to go, huh? You taught me a lot!","I hope we can be worthy rivals from now on. If you're willing, let's breed our monsters next time!","Well, let's head back.","Heh... Don't let it get you down. You weren't weak! I was just a little stronger, that's all.","By the way, is there a master called Milly in GreatLog? She's my sister. I wonder where she's gone...","Show me your real strength! That can't be all you've got!"]}],"npc-teto":[{"place":"GreatTree arena district","passages":["Teto","[your name]! I've been waiting. Let's get started right away, before I get nervous!","How are you feeling? I'm in perfect form! Come on, let's start before I get nervous!","Oh! I-I'm sorry for acting so superior! I'll turn over a new leaf and start again from scratch! By the way, [your name]! Would you like to breed our monsters? Mine is an Ice Golem. Shall we breed them?","Let me know whenever you want to breed our monsters!","Would you like to breed a monster with my Ice Golem? I know it's probably asking too much, but a Lava Golem would be ideal!","Which monster would you like to breed with Ice Golem?","I hope a strong monster is born! I'll send the egg to the farm!","From now on, I'll keep working steadily and won't get carried away! [your name], let's stay friends!","Monsters don't learn skills while they're left on the farm. I only found that out recently. I can't stand around here! I have to go to the farm!","You've cleared Class D! Congratulations! Apparently, monsters don't learn skills while they're left on the farm! I only found that out recently. I can't stand around here! I have to go to the farm!","Oh, [your name]! Listen to this! While you were away, [your name], I made it to Class C! I look forward to facing you in the final Class C match!","[your name]! Please battle me again sometime!","[your name], you really are strong! Keep it up. Oh, I know! Shall we breed our monsters? Would you like to breed a monster with my Eyeder?","Would you like to breed a monster with my Eyeder?","Which monster would you like to breed with Eyeder?","Breeding identical monsters should just produce the same monster, right? It's strange. I got a different monster. Are there some combinations that work that way?","Breeding identical monsters should just produce the same monster, right? It's strange. I got a different monster. So sometimes breeding two of the same species produces a different one!","[your name], only Class S remains. I'd like to help, however little I can! Would you like to breed a monster with my Yeti?","Would you like to breed a monster with my Yeti?","Which monster would you like to breed with Yeti?","[your name], congratulations on becoming our representative! I'd like to help, however little I can! Would you like to breed a monster with my Yeti?","The Starry Night tournament... What a wonderful sound that has! [your name], I'm praying with all my heart that you'll win!","You've finally come this far! I'm nowhere near your level anymore, [your name]. Good luck in the tournament!","[your name]! Congratulations on your wonderful victory! I'm so happy...sniff...so happy...boo-hoo... Th-they say some monsters in this world belong to none of the families. They're incredibly strong, and won't join you even if you defeat them. But if they're that strong, I'd love to find a way to recruit them!","Th-they say some monsters in this world belong to none of the families. They're incredibly strong, and won't join you even if you defeat them. But if they're that strong, I'd love to find a way to recruit them!"]},{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["[your name] won! Hooray! Hooray!"]}],"npc-tife":[{"place":"GreatTree arena district","passages":["It seems I've gotten lost. At times like this, it's best to stay calm and wait patiently, right?","Phew. Some people left trash in the stands... It bothered me, so I picked it up. Now it's lovely and clean!","Come to think of it, I feel like there was something else I had to do... I've forgotten.","Come to think of it, I was about to enter a match. But I can't compete all by myself, can I?! Huh...?","Huh? You already know? Have we met somewhere before?","I know you! You're Teto, aren't you?","Hey, are the matches over already?","But... I don't think I've had my match yet. Disqualified again, I suppose... And I'm hungry... Sigh...","Of course! My match isn't over yet. But my monsters have gotten lost. At this rate... I'll miss my match again, and everyone will be angry with me.","Disqualified again, I suppose... And I'm hungry... Sigh... It's all right. It's all my fault anyway...","My monsters have gotten lost. At this rate... I'll miss my match again, and everyone will be angry with me.","Mickey! I finally found my monsters! I hear this Starry Night tournament is being held in GreatTree, so I'll do my best!","Whaaat?! Really?! It's already over?!","That's no good! If we get a wish, I want to wish for something better!","I don't think I'll recover from this shock for a while.","I'm glad I can take it easy for a while!","Um... I'm a master named Tife...","Huh? Is the match over already?","I still can't find them... They must have stopped liking me... If they'd come out now, I'd share a little of my snack!","Sigh. Where could they have gone?","Hic... I drank...alcohol...by mistake... Whooo..."]}],"npc-warubou":[{"place":"Your Room · opening","passages":["Are you Milly?! ...No, I'm sure Milly was a girl. What? Your name's [your name]? Then I've got no business with you!","You're Milly, aren't you? You're coming with me!","The name's Warubou. Warubou of GreatLog! Don't you forget it!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Castle","passages":["This time, you don't have to search for a replacement navel... You can begin your own journey! One that's yours alone!","How many worlds are there? Nobody knows! We'll never run out of worlds to explore!"]},{"place":"Beneath GreatLog Castle","passages":["I'm starving to death here!","What a mouthy prince! All right! Let's settle this!","Hey! You can't just crash into GreatLog's navel... Grr!","GreatLog's navel broke?! G-GreatLog's life force!","Hey! Running away on your own?! Useless brat!","Argh! No choice!","Gah! Will this hold?! You two, come here!","Look what you've done! You broke GreatLog's precious navel! At this rate, the whole kingdom will sink for sure!","This is all because you had that nut pie... Anyway, there's no time!","Bring something to replace the navel! Anything!","Oh, you've brought a replacement for the navel! Quick, let me see!","Well, it certainly looks about the right size. Now, let's hope it works...","Good! But this is only a stopgap. Something like this can't truly replace GreatLog's navel. It has to be a special object filled with great power! While this holds, I'll go to another world...","Y-you two... Are you trying to kill me with that pot?! Just you wait! I'll get you back for this!","...All right! I'll be brave. I've made up my mind! You two will have to go to the other worlds!","There's no other way! I can't move from here.","This is a magic key. It opens the way to another world. And it's a rare one, filled with a spirit's power! Use it on the magic door up ahead, and you'll go straight to another world! There's bound to be something there that can replace the navel!","Now get going! I keep telling you, there's no time! You're the only ones who can save GreatLog!","...W-wait a second! I forgot this!","Use this key to return to GreatLog from another world! It's the only one we've got! Whatever you do, don't lose it!","...Well, I'll put a little faith in you. Hurry and find a replacement navel!","Hey! You haven't forgotten your promise to me, have you?!","Then quit wasting time here! Hurry up and find a replacement for the navel! Got it?!","What?! How could you forget?! Listen! Use the magic key to open the magic door up ahead! Go to the other world and find a replacement for the navel! Use the GreatLog Key to come back here. Got it now? Hurry up, [your name]!","Oh, [your name]! Looks like you're still in one piece. I'll share some of GreatLog's power with you. Be grateful!","There, all healed! Now get back to the other world!","Hey, [your name]! Don't tell me you got beaten?! You'll never save GreatLog with that feeble effort! Since I'm so generous, I'll share some of GreatLog's power with you!","Well done, [your name]! I'll share GreatLog's power with you!","There, all healed! ...So, what about a replacement for GreatLog's navel?","I see. So this is... Hmm, the Sea Bell, is it...? I can certainly feel a strange power coming from it! Let's see right away if it can replace GreatLog's navel!","Yes! It stopped! GreatLog is sav... Hm?","Whoa, whoa, whoa! This is bad! ...Argh, no choice!","No good! The Sea Bell's no use! I was a fool to think it might work!","Still, the Sea Bell does seem to have a strange power... Hold out your hand. Now... Grip it like that... Hah!","Good! You now have the power to cross the sea! When you want to cross, press the Triangle button near the water. Whether you make good use of it is up to you! Just try not to sink halfway across!","...Hm! I've got a feeling! I sense a strange power! ...The sea! I can see a battered pirate ship on the water. You'll have to find the key this time too! It seems to be somewhere in GreatLog! ...It's called the Pirate Key. Don't forget! And I'll hold on to the Sea Bell.","Quit standing around in a daze! Find the Pirate Key! It has to be somewhere in GreatLog!","[your name], what took you so long?! Kameha brought a Pirate Key here before you did! Apparently he pestered the king into giving it to him. Stop daydreaming and get to the other world! I've got a little more faith in you than in Kameha. Hurry and find an item with mysterious power!","Hey! Quit daydreaming and get to the other world!","Hey! Stop hanging around and get to the other world! Show some spirit! Don't come back till you've found a replacement navel!","...Hmm. So this is... The Mirror of Destruction...? I can really feel its strange power!","So that's all the Mirror of Destruction could do! Hey, [your name]! Are you planning to leave me stuck here forever?! Even I'm getting tired of this!","But the Mirror of Destruction does seem to have a strange power. [your name], hold out your hand. ...Hah!","Good! You now have the power to break things! When you find a suitable rock, stand in front of it and press the Triangle button.","Oh! There's that feeling again! I sense a strange power! Brr... It's cold... I can see a world sealed in ice. You probably know by now, but I don't have the key.","It should be somewhere in GreatLog. Go and find it! It's probably called the Ice Key! Don't get the wrong one!","How long are you going to leave me crammed in here?! Hurry and find the Ice Key!","Hey, [your name]! You're late! Far too late! Kameha beat you to the other world again! Well, even I respect how quick he is with his hands! Anyway, whether GreatLog floats or sinks is up to you!","There, all healed! ...Hurry and show me the replacement navel!","...So this is the Sky Shield! Now this is something special! This'll make a perfect replacement for GreatLog's navel!","...Oh! Just as I thought! A perfect fit! My job is finally done!","...Looking at you now, you've really become a monster master. From now on, explore other worlds with your own purpose! ...Actually, maybe you don't even need a purpose. Visit their towns... Meet their people. ...Hm?","What?! Even the Sky Shield didn't work?!","I know, I know! ...Hm? What's that you've got?","It's better than nothing! We'll use it to replace the navel!","Oh?! We did it! It's taken the place of GreatLog's navel!","Thanks to you, GreatLog is saved for real this time! ...Hm? What? Still not convinced? I'm a spirit, and I'm telling you it's fine! Don't worry! Go home and rest after your journey! Starting tomorrow, visit other worlds or do whatever you like!","This is bad... It held out well enough till now... But it's only a matter of time! Blast! Useless thing!","N-no way... Isn't this just an ordinary Gulpple?!","Hey, Kameha! What is the meaning of this?!","Hey, wait! Running away again?!","So this is how it ends up after all!","You know what I'm going to say! That's right! Go find another replacement for the navel! And don't complain! I've got plenty to say myself... More than enough! Now hurry up and hold out your hand! I'll give you the Sky Shield's power! ...Hah!","Good. You should have the power to fly now... Try pressing the Triangle button somewhere you might be able to fly across...","...There's that feeling again! I sense a strange power! ...Oh! I can see land floating in the sky... The key is probably called the Sky Key. Hurry and bring it!","Honestly, I'm completely worn out... The key's probably called the Sky Key! Don't let Kameha beat you this time. He's bound to have gone to the king again!","Oh, you've got the Sky Key, [your name]. Looks like Kameha's gone ahead of you again. ...This is really getting hard for me... A replacement for GreatLog's navel... I'm counting on you this time, [your name]!","I'll leave the rest to you... I'm exhausted...","Blast that Kameha... Oh, [your name], it's you. I trust you. I'm leaving everything in your hands! You understand?! We're out of time!","Oh, Kameha's with you! Are you both all right?! I wanted to bring you back sooner, but his power was blocking me... Well, good work! Let me heal you first!","...We're in a real mess! But first, there's something I need to say! Hey, Kameha!","Just how carefree can you be?! If you found a replacement navel, you should have come straight back! This is your fault!","Blaming Kameha alone wasn't going to help. GreatLog has so little life force lef... Hm?","It looks like we're really running out of time. ...Hey, [your name]! Find it this time! Fail again, and there won't be a GreatLog to come back to!","There's no time to stand there in shock. I've kept the treasures that couldn't replace the navel. I'll give them to you when you're ready to leave for the World Between Worlds.","Are you ready to leave for the World Between Worlds?","Well, hurry up! Once you're ready to leave... I'll give you the three treasures, so make room in your belongings!","All right! Here are the three treasures from other worlds that couldn't replace the navel!","Actually, I repaired those treasures and kept them safe. Here, take them!","The World Between Worlds is his home ground. Be careful!","...Or I'd give them to you, but your belongings are too full to hold all three!","Find a replacement for GreatLog's navel this time! ...GreatLog hardly has any life force left...","There, all healed! Now hurry and show me!","...Oh, so this is... The Mysterious Navel. Hmm... That's my [your name]! I believed in you till the very end! Let's see right away if it can replace GreatLog's navel!","Look! A perfect fit! You finally did it, [your name]!","...Hm?! Did the ground just shake a little?","Whoa! It looks like we were too late! We sealed the navel, but there wasn't enough... Life force left to keep GreatLog afloat! After all we've done!","I suppose there's nothing more we can do... You did your best. Maybe this is fate. ...All right! Tell everyone to escape from the island. I'll stay here and try to buy a little more time... This is goodbye... Take care... [your name].","...Come on, get going!","Blast... Even I can't go any further... And I still haven't settled my score with Watabou... [your name]... Kameha... Everyone on the island! You'd better make it out alive!","What's going on...? What in the world is this?!","...GreatLog and the other worlds... Even if people live in different worlds... The bonds they forge can still hold strong. Thank you. This is all thanks to you, [your name]!","Hey, how've you been? Still traveling, I see. GreatLog's thriving thanks to everything you did!","Hey, [your name]! How could you get beaten?! You'll never make it as a master with that feeble effort! Since I'm so generous, I'll share some of GreatLog's power with you!","I've got a favor to ask, because I trust your skill as a master! My kid says he wants to go traveling...","I'd worry if he went alone. I want you to take him with you. ...But it looks like you already have all the companions you can hold.","I'd worry if he went alone. Will you take him with you?","Come on, that's cold... After all we've been through together?","I knew I'd picked the right master! Hey! Petitbou! Come here a second!","He's cheeky, but I think he'll be useful enough!","I'll send him straight to the farm. Look after him!","The bonds between people and monsters have grown much stronger. I think your adventures helped make that happen! Anyway, don't worry. GreatLog is safe now.","You know, when you think about it, GreatLog's already saved. It should be fine even if I'm not here, right? The truth is, I've been itching to go traveling!","How about it? Will you take me along too?","...But it looks like you already have all the companions you can hold.","I'll be at the farm. Here's to more adventures together!","Zzz... Zzz...","Don't rush me! I'll be right there. Go on ahead to the farm!"]},{"place":"GreatLog farm","passages":["Oh, [your name]! There you are! I've been looking for you! Just as I feared, Kameha's replacement navel has started shaking! You're coming with me to GreatLog's navel! You know what happens if it fails, right? ...Exactly! Come on!"]},{"place":"GreatLog","passages":["Ow, ow... What are you doing, you stupid prince?! ...All that anger's made me hungry.","...Hm?! I smell something delicious over there!","That smells like nut pie! It's my lucky day! Sorry about this, but I'll help myself!"]},{"place":"GreatLog Main Street","passages":["I'm Warubou, spirit of GreatLog! Waru, waru! You might not know this, but when a spirit like me says something... You do whatever I say! Remember that!","Good idea! We can buy snacks with the money.","Hey, Kameha! Don't pull so hard! You're stretching out my favorite nut pie!","Look! It fell because you lot kept pulling!"]},{"place":"GreatTree Castle","passages":["Hey, old man! Did you call me!?","Too bad! I bet Watabou ran away! Maybe GreatTree ought to disappear altogether!","Hey! We meet again! Don't look so unhappy to see me. Believe it or not, I'm rooting for you!","If you keep at it, everyone in GreatLog will be delighted! We're even getting a party ready in GreatLog. A party to celebrate GreatLog winning, of course.","If you become the representative, GreatLog will have an easy victory!!"]},{"place":"GreatTree arena district","passages":["I went to all that trouble to recruit you because I believed in your talent. Too bad, Milly! You're no use to me anymore!"]},{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["Chomp, chomp...","Crunch, crunch...","What do you want? Want to eat this?","Hahaha! Serves you right!","Huh? What's that?! Don't you want to eat this?","You really don't want any? I could share some, if you like.","Don't be shy! I'm heading home soon... Eat it whenever you get hungry!"]},{"place":"Rondalkia","passages":["Huh?! How did I end up in a place like this?! Where's the exit?","Huh? Wh-what's going on?! Waaah!"]},{"place":"Spirit's Spring","passages":["Whoops! Sorry about that. I mistook you for Watabou and hit you before I knew it. Anyway, I'm in a hurry. See you!"]},{"place":"Demon King's Castle","passages":["...Hey, can you hear me, [your name]? You're in quite a mess now. Stay right there! I'm bringing you back to GreatLog!"]},{"place":"Dork’s Manor","passages":["...Hey, can you hear me, [your name]? You found a replacement for the navel! Stay right there! I'm bringing you back to GreatLog!"]},{"place":"Mirage Lake and the bandits’ hideout","passages":["...Hey, can you hear me, [your name]? I felt a mysterious power! Looks like you've found something to replace the navel! Stay still! I'm bringing you back to GreatLog!"]},{"place":"Spirit’s Spring and the tunnel to Nofo","passages":["...Hey, can you hear me, [your name]? I felt a mysterious power! You've finally found a replacement for GreatLog's navel! Stay still! I'm bringing you back to GreatLog!"]},{"place":"Volcanic Island Cave","passages":["Hey, can you hear me, [your name]? I sensed a strange power! You've finally found a replacement for GreatLog's navel! Stay right there! I'm bringing you back to GreatLog!"]}],"npc-watabou":[{"place":"Your Room · opening","passages":["Wata, wata! Where could Milly be? Wata, wata!","Oh? Who are you? Huh? Her little brother? Wata, wata! Then do you know where Milly is? What?! She's been taken away?! Oh no! I'm too late! Warubou? No, no! I'm Watabou! Huh? You want me to tell you where your sister went?","Hmm... Then follow me. You want to bring your sister back, don't you? I hope you're a skilled monster master! You don't know what I mean? Come along and you'll see! Wata, wata!"]},{"place":"Your Room · returning home","passages":["Give me that meat!","Give me the meat and I'll join you!","Good morning, [your name]! It's time for adventure! I'll be waiting in the barn. Hurry over!"]},{"place":"GreatTree","passages":["You'll get hurt if you let outward beauty fool you! Well, shall we head home?"]},{"place":"GreatTree Castle","passages":["Hi, [your name]. I see you've made some monster friends. Huh? You want me to join you? Hee hee. I don't think [your name] could handle me just yet. But I'll think about it. Wata, wata!","Looks like you're getting used to this world. At this rate, you might become GreatTree's representative! Just what I'd expect from the master I chose! Or is that going a bit far? ...Anyway, keep up the good work!"]},{"place":"GreatTree farm","passages":["Munch, munch...","Crunch, crunch...","Want some?","Win the championship for us!","[your name]! Glad you came! I told you I'd join you, [your name]... But I won't make it that easy! [your name], there are still Travelers' Gates you haven't visited, right? Defeat the strongest monster in every one of them! Beat them all, and I'll join you.","[your name], there are still Travelers' Gates you haven't visited, right? Defeat the strongest monster in every one of them! Beat them all, and I'll join you.","You did it, [your name]! You beat them all! I'll join you, as promised! Is that all right?","I see. You don't want me... You have grown strong, [your name].","Oh? You've already got too many monsters! Sorry, but I can't join you.","Here's to us, [your name]! I'll wait on the farm!","Oh, and thank you for winning! GreatLog's Warubou was really frustrated. And thanks to you, a new spirit was born...!"]},{"place":"Departure Gate","passages":["[your name], you did it! Let's go back to the castle!"]},{"place":"Swamp Cave","passages":["You don't need to worry about the princess. Let's... go... back... to... the... castle!"]},{"place":"Melkido Town","passages":["This town is an illusion Golemus is seeing, you know. That's why we can't go inside, you know... Huh? I'm starting to talk funny! Let's go home, you know!"]},{"place":"Monster's Den","passages":["The Great Sabrecat seems to have taken a liking to you! But shouldn't it wait for its real master...? Oh well. Let's return to the castle."]},{"place":"Imul Forest","passages":["Well done finding your way through the forest maze. You have to use your head sometimes! Let's go home."]},{"place":"Domdora Town","passages":["Monsters destroyed this town long ago. The demon knight has been waiting here for the hero ever since. Come on. Let's return to the castle."]},{"place":"Casino","passages":["Even the casino troublemaker has taken a liking to you! Shall we go back to the castle?"]},{"place":"Tower of God","passages":["Follow the path you believe in, without hesitation! Even if you make a mistake, you can try again. Let's return to the castle!"]},{"place":"Rondalkia","passages":["Ooh! I wonder if Warubou's all right. Oh well. Let's go home!"]},{"place":"Lenoole Castle","passages":["This place gives me the creeps. Let's... gooo... hooome!"]},{"place":"Arp Tower","passages":["What a mischievous fellow! Shall we go home?"]},{"place":"Dancer's Stage","passages":["Hey, yo! How's it going? The fun show's over! Let's go home!"]},{"place":"Traveler's Cave","passages":["That man just now... He looked a little like you, [your name]. It seems those eggs were the reason there were so many monsters... Well, that's the mystery solved. Let's report to the king!"]},{"place":"Land of Happiness","passages":["You can't build a land of happiness just like that. Let's return to GreatTree. It's small, but it's a happy place!"]},{"place":"Lifecod Village","passages":["Ow, hot! I'll put out the fire. You go and rest at the castle."]},{"place":"Tower of Trials","passages":["Wow! It's little old Watabou! Let's go home, darling!","Ho ho ho! Let's go home and get a lovely night's sleep!","I feel all fuzzy and sleepy. Let's go home..."]},{"place":"Mysterious Cave","passages":["That doll of me over there is really well made, isn't it? Hee hee... Let's return to the castle! Baa!"]},{"place":"Prison Town","passages":["[your name]'s companions don't bear any grudge against [your name]. Don't worry about it. Just give it your all! Let's go home!"]},{"place":"Zipang Cave","passages":["[your name], we're going home! GWAAAARGH!","Someone helped you, didn't they?! I saw everything. Oh, I don't mind. But he does look like you, [your name]. Let's return to the castle!"]},{"place":"Hell Cloud Castle","passages":["[your name]... You've grown so much stronger! Let's go home!"]},{"place":"Dragonlord's Castle","passages":["That's one down! Let's go home!"]},{"place":"Hargon's Castle","passages":["Huh? I think I can still smell a monster... Let's turn back for now! Come on, we're going home!","So there really was another monster here! It's safe now! Let's go home!"]},{"place":"Baramos's Castle","passages":["You even defeated a great Demon King! Amazing! Let's return to the castle!"]},{"place":"Zoma's Castle","passages":["There's always someone stronger. Well, that's enough for today."]},{"place":"Mountain Summit","passages":["Rosalie was the name of Psaro's beloved. But humans tormented her, and Rosalie... Psaro gave up everything for revenge. It's not that anyone was wholly to blame, but Psaro chose the wrong path. [your name], you'll be all right. Come on, let's go home."]},{"place":"Enigmatic Cave","passages":["Somewhere in the world, neither in the past nor the future... Perhaps that is where Estark was born. Let's let him sleep again. We're going home!"]},{"place":"Evil Mountain","passages":["You've really grown strong! Let's return to the castle!"]},{"place":"Mudo's Castle","passages":["Even insects have souls! It's easy to underestimate an opponent. What really matters is knowing how strong they are! Let's return to the castle!"]},{"place":"Castle Between Worlds","passages":["Deathmore is the strongest of all the Demon Kings! But I'm sure he doesn't look like an old man when he's at his strongest... Oh well. Let's return to the castle!"]},{"place":"Nameless Place","passages":["Amazing, [your name]! You even defeated a god! Huh? A spirit? That's what they call me! Well, it's about time we returned to the castle!"]}],"npc-yuna":[{"place":"Border Mine","passages":["That's right! After all, [your name] saved me!","That was the spirit of the spring...? [your name], you really are her messenger! J-just kidding! I believed you a little!"]},{"place":"Westernia Castle","passages":["W-wait! Listen to me!","I'm all right now! But there's something more important... Grandfather!","The northern king...? Who told you such a lie!?","...The fortune-teller? So that's who told you to attack the north!?","I knew it! The fortune-teller fled because my soul returned!","...I must have overheard the fortune-teller discussing a plan with a monster... ...and had my soul stolen because of it!","Their plan was to make the northern and western kingdoms fight! If we attack the north, we'll be doing exactly what they want! We have to make peace with the northern kingdom and stop the fighting at once!","Oh, right! I forgot! This is the child who saved me!","............","...Huh? What am I...? ...I finally remember. I'm Yuna, the princess of this kingdom. I saw a man dressed in black talking to a monster in the forest... That's right! They caught me listening to them. Then the monster stole my soul and took control of me. What were that man and the monster talking about...? Yes! Now I remember! They planned to steal the Sky Shield! They wanted to make people fight so the spirit of the spring would lose its power!","This is terrible! I must tell Grandfather at once! [your name], come with me!","Oh, [your name]! You're looking well! Let's go out together again sometime! Promise!"]}],"boss-dragon":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Grrrrooo... What... do... you... want?","Grrr... Have... you... come... to... take... the... princess? I... won't... let... you... have... her. GRAAARRR!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You've... come... back... I'll... play... with... you!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Who... are... you?"]}],"boss-golem":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["...","Hold on a moment, you know... I can't let you through, you know... You see, I've been told not to let anyone pass... Because I'm Golemus the golem, the town's guardian, you know!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You've been here before, you know. You just don't give up, you know!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Even though you beat me, you still can't enter the town, you know."]}],"boss-great-sabrecat":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Grrr...! ...!? Grr... Hiss, hiss...! Grrgle...? Grrgla...? ... ... ... ... ... ... ... ... ... Geregere!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Grrgla...? Tsk, tsk, tsk... Geregere!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["[your name], me come too! Friends! Friends!"]}],"boss-treeface":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Kee hee hee! Well done making it this far, boy. But what a shame! You've reached a dead end!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Kee hee hee! You must face life's obstacles again and again!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Well done overcoming that obstacle! But your life is only just beginning!"]}],"boss-fang-slime":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Grrr...! I'm not winning a thing! Huh? What are you staring at?! This ain't a sideshow! Go play somewhere else, kid!","Grrr! Why are you the only one raking it in?! That monster gold is mine! Hand it over!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["What, you haven't had enough yet? That monster gold belongs to me!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["I-I give up, boss! I... er, your humble servant... I won't cause any more trouble in the casino. I swear! I'll play nice so everyone can have fun!"]}],"boss-big-eye":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["With courage, you can cross even the widest chasm. Now it's my turn. Let's see you put that courage to use!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You're surprisingly persistent! Come on, then!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["With courage, you can cross even the widest chasm. Whatever adventures lie ahead, never give up!"]}],"boss-living-statue":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["You... saaaw... meee...!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You... saaaw... meee... agaaain!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["I... looost..."]}],"boss-battle-rex":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["For my kind to flourish above all others in this world... That is my wish. I know not why you have come... But interfere with me, and I shall show you no mercy!","For my kind to flourish above all others in this world... That is my wish. How dare you stand in my way...! You shall pay! I will crush you and send you to the underworld!","What have you done...?! Unforgivable... Utterly unforgivable! My kind should stand above all others in this world! Begone!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["My rage will not subside until I have defeated you all!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Nothing can be achieved through anger... Is that what you mean...?"]}],"boss-funky-bird":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Yo! Hey, yo, yo! Don't just stand there, yo!","You've got some killer moves! Come on, let's dance!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Oh! Is this what I think it is? A revenge dance-off?!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Ha-ha! Brother, you're the best!"]}],"boss-sky-dragon":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Heh heh! Correct! Now come at me with everything you've got!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Right again! But too bad... This is as far as you go!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Ow, ow... Hey, you're pretty strong!"]}],"boss-jamiras":[{"place":"The speech","passages":["Comrades! Has the time not come for us to rise up... And open the door to a new world?! Yes! A world of monsters, by monsters, and solely for monsters!","A world where we can eat sirloin morning, noon, and night...! That is the world I promise you, comrades! I do not lie! Rise up, comrades!","Hmm...?! My back is itching! My fellow monsters! Forgive me for turning my back on you for a moment!","Hmph! A mere human dares interrupt my speech? I'll teach you a lesson!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["To achieve a dream world where we can eat sirloin every day... Gah! My back again...! Comrades, bear with me a moment!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["At least... At least... One piece of sirloin a day!"]}],"boss-demon-servant":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Keh heh heh! Burn, burn! Let this whole village burn to ashes! Huh? What, do you want to try too?","Keh heh heh! Burn it! Burn it! Burn this village to the ground! Huh? Don't just stand there! Go set something else on fire!","What's with you? You're no fun at all. Now you've made me really angry... I could set you on fire instead!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You again... Burn!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Boil me, burn me... Do whatever you like! Guh!"]}],"boss-dark-horn":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Baa! Baa! Well done making it this far! I acknowledge your efforts. Buuut! I have some unfortunate news... All that hard work is about to go down the drain! Baa!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Oh, you've come back! You're a master who never learns. I've time on my hands, so I'll take you on!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Baa... Y-you're rather good! I like you, mighty master!"]}],"boss-akbar":[{"place":"The trial","passages":["The accused, [your name]! Your trial begins now! The accused forced unwilling monsters to become companions... Then made them fight one another in the name of training, suffering total defeat time and again! Do you admit your guilt?!","Wh-what?! You dare defy me, your judge...?! Then I shall inflict your punishment upon you myself!","Very well! I shall deliver my verdict! ...Guilty, of course! Submit to the guillotine without a struggle!","Let the guillotine wash away your sins without a struggle!","What? Surely you aren't saying you don't want the guillotine?!","Then stop wandering about and put your neck on the block!","Grrr! A criminal like you dares defy me?! Very well! I'll knock your head off with my own hands!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Have you come to wash away your sins? Then struggle no more!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["What do you hope to gain by piling sin upon sin...?"]}],"boss-durran":[{"place":"The challenges","passages":["Welcome to my Hell Cloud Castle, young monster master! That gleam in your eyes... You're no ordinary child. I seek the strong. Show me your strength.","Come! Show me the full extent of your power!","You do not know how to give up. That alone makes you remarkable. Challenge me as many times as you need to satisfy yourself!","You defeated him with ease! Good! Such splendid strength! Then let another challenger face you! He seeks the power to triumph over all. A man who traveled the world and finally reached me... Come forth!","A man who offered me even his soul in pursuit of supreme power... The strongest swordsman! Now fight to your hearts' content!","Will you pursue your own potential with such hunger?! And with this man as your opponent... This should be quite a spectacle!","Surpass yourself! And prove which of you is the real one!"]},{"place":"The final duel","passages":["...Heh heh! Ha ha ha! Where does your strength come from...? To surpass something is also to cast something precious aside. Will my convictions prevail, or will your way of life...?","Come at me with everything you've got! Let's settle this!","Have you gained more power? Have you grown stronger?! My soul trembles... Show me your strength...!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["I think I can finally glimpse the source of your strength... I have always believed that the power one is born with is everything. But you are different. Your effort and faith in your companions have made your strength unshakable! Heh heh heh... Truly splendid! I am proud to have fought you. Farewell for now, [your name]. We shall meet again in a distant tomorrow! Now, you pitiful swordsman, defeated by your own past self... I shall release you. Do as you please. You have your younger self to thank."]}],"boss-darkdrium":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["I am called Darkdrium, god of destruction and slaughter. You who have heard my voice...","Do you possess the power to defeat me? You need not answer. Battle will reveal the truth. Come. I shall return everything to nothingness!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["In truth, I did not expect to see you again. Strange one who befriends monsters... Will you try to befriend even me? Mwa ha ha! I take orders from no one. My life is not yours to command! Know your place!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["For the first time since my birth, I have tasted defeat. Yet I still cannot follow you. We shall meet elsewhere, in another form. If there comes a time when I am reborn... I cannot yet know. But should that time come, I shall follow you. The ultimate force born of a spirit and a Demon King... That is the only path that leads to me! Farewell, [your name]! One day we shall meet again!"]}],"boss-demon-knight":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["I wait... for the one they call the hero... Do not disturb me. Begone!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Do not make me repeat myself. I told you to leave!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["...I yield. You have defeated me..."]}],"boss-gigantes":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Ooh! Some tasty-looking meat!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Ooh! That tasty-looking meat came back!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Ooh! Give me tasty meat and I'll do what you say!"]}],"boss-king-slime":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Hee hee! Let this dynamite body send you into a peaceful slumber...!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["My, my, aren't you a wild one? Ho ho ho..."]}],"boss-lips":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Welcome, darling! Let's get those smoochy-smooches started!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Wow! You're pretty good, aren't you!"]}],"boss-matango":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["I'll put you to sleep with my sweet breath, and then... Ho ho ho!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["You're the finest man I've ever met! If this is a dream, don't let me wake up!"]}],"boss-orochi":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Gwoooar...! Child of a foreign land, why have you come? I am in a foul mood... I will not stop... I cannot stop...!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["There... is... no... stopping... me... now... GUWAAAAARGH!"]},{"place":"After the confrontation","passages":["Gwaaaargh...","Gwaaaargh... To suffer this humiliation twice...!"]}],"boss-dragonlord":[{"place":"The offer","passages":["Welcome, [your name]! I am the king of kings, the Dragonlord. I have been waiting. Waiting for a young one such as you to appear before me. Join me, and I shall give you half the world. What say you? Will you become my ally?","Well spoken! Then I grant you half the world... The world of darkness! I shall personally guide you there!","What? Surely it is a generous offer? Do you truly mean to refuse half the world?","Then you are determined never to join me? You fool! Learn the price of your defiance!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Back again, boy? You never learn. For a mere human to defy me... I shall never forgive it! I will burn you to ashes!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["You defeated me... You are no ordinary mortal!"]}],"boss-hargon":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Who is it...? What fool disturbs my slumber...? Do you know that I am Hargon, the high priest?","Reckless human! Regret your foolishness! I am Hargon, ruler of all!","You've some nerve to come this far knowing nothing. Then remember this! I am the one who rules over all!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You have returned, insect. You do not know your place. Let me see you writhe on the brink of terror!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Y-you wretch...! How vexing...! I acknowledge your strength. But in this world... There are beings against whom such power is utterly helpless! Remember that well. Mwa ha ha!"]}],"boss-shido":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["MY NAME IS SHIDO. DESTROYER OF ALL... I HAVE BUT ONE DESIRE... TOTAL DESTRUCTION!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["FRAIL, WEAK CREATURES. BE SHATTERED ONCE MORE...!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["..."]}],"boss-baramos":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["So you have finally reached me, wretched creatures. You know not your place if you think you can defeat Baramos, the great Demon King. You shall regret coming here! So that you never dare return... I shall tear out your entrails and devour every last scrap!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Fools! You have returned?! It seems I must teach you the meaning of true terror. And the greatness of Baramos!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["I-impossible! How could I, Baramos...?!"]}],"boss-zoma":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Well done reaching me, human child. I am Zoma, destroyer of all! I shall make all life my sacrifice... And shroud the world in despair! Why do you struggle, suffer, and go on living...? Destruction is my delight. Those who die are truly beautiful. Now breathe your last in my arms!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Have you returned to taste the fear of death once more? However often you fight, the result will be the same, young human. This time, you shall know true despair!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["What is your name? I see. You are called [your name]. You have done well to defeat me. But where there is light, there is also darkness. As you grow stronger... An even greater darkness will rise to stand in your way. The battle never ends."]}],"boss-psaro":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Gwoooar...! Who are you...? I am Psa... Psaro...! I have awakened as king of the demonkind! Guh... Gwaaaargh! I... I cannot remember anything...! But I know what I must do! Do you know what that is?","Nngwaaaargh! ...Then! Regret appearing before me on this day, at this hour!","Heh heh... You do not know? Then I shall tell you! Foolish humans, and the filthy dogs... That those humans have tamed! I shall wipe you all out! I will smash you to pieces! Uwaaaargh!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["More and more, I cease to be myself...! In exchange, I have gained power beyond all others! There is no stopping me now, foolish humans! You are the ones who made me this way!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Gwaaaargh! My body burns...! Have I been defeated...? Is this the end...? Rosalie... I... I..."]}],"boss-estark":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Grrrr... I have awakened...! My name is Estark. That is all I know for now. Whether I am good or evil... I do not even know that... What do you want with me? Have you come to destroy me?","Then leave. I shall sleep a little longer.","I see... Perhaps I exist in order to fight you. That is enough for now. Come at me!","Grrrr... You're still here...! You are far too noisy... I wish to sleep. I shall make you be quiet!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Grrrr... You've returned... You must be very fond of fighting. Come, young one. Fight until you are satisfied!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Grrrr... I have lost... I remember... one thing. I was defeated once before... Long, long ago. My opponent had eyes as clear and pure as yours."]}],"boss-mildrath":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["So you have finally come! Monster master [your name], and your companions! You know who I am, do you not?","Fwa ha ha! A proper attitude, human. I am Mildrath, ruler of the demon realm and king of kings. You have come to defeat me, have you not? Then I shall show you the full extent of my power!","You came all this way without knowing? You imbecile! To think you do not know Mildrath, ruler of the demon realm and king of kings! Then I shall carve my name into your heart. I will show you why I rule the demon realm!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["You have returned, [your name], with your companions. It seems you have not yet learned enough fear. Do not trouble me any further!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Wh-what is this? I have lost...? Impossible! Unacceptable! Unthinkable! Ah... Of course! This is a dream! That explains it! Mwa ha ha! A dream! This is a dream! Mwa ha ha...!"]}],"boss-mudo":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Welcome, little insects! My name is Mudo. Surely you have heard of me?","What? I shall ask again. You know my name, do you not?","Very good. Now, my little friends... Have you prepared your graves?","What?! Have you at least prepared the coffins you will sleep in?!","Such obedient little insects. Then go to sleep!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Crush an insect as often as you like, and it still comes crawling back... How tiresome! I shall grind you into dust!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["What does that make me, to be defeated by mere insects...?! Y-you wretches!"]}],"boss-deathmore":[{"place":"Before battle","passages":["Ho ho ho... I left you to your little games, and now you've grown conceited... I was just considering going out to crush you... Yet here you come, walking straight in. Fools! I scarcely need to introduce myself. I am Deathmore! The one destined to rule over all...! Come, then! Challenge me, you insects who defy your king! I shall show you how powerless and insignificant you are... With the might of a true king!"]},{"place":"Rematch","passages":["Back again? How pointless... Utterly pointless. Even after being crushed so thoroughly... You still fail to comprehend the terror of Deathmore. However much you train, it is useless! I am the being who rules and controls everything! Even your growth proceeds according to my will! Come, worthless creatures. Challenge me as often as you wish. Deathmore is the king of all living things! I shall crush you again and again until you understand!"]},{"place":"After battle","passages":["Y-you wretches! If only I could unleash my true power! I, Deathmore, would never lose to a mere child!"]}],"boss-dam-builder":[{"place":"Underground Waterway","passages":["D-destroy the dam!? You must be joking!","I worked hard to build this dam! Don't say such awful things about destroying it! If you make us any angrier, you'll be sorry!","No! Our lives depend on this dam.","I'm building a home here for my whole clan! You're trying to get in our way, aren't you?","What!? Then I won't hold back anymore!","...I see. Good, then. Take that old fellow and go home!","Whoa, you're strong! ...All right, I lose. I never meant to cause trouble for the townspeople.","We used to live peacefully in a home we'd built at Mirage Lake. Then those bandits came along and turned it into their hideout! So I was looking for somewhere my whole clan could live safely. The water here was clean, so I thought this would make a good home.","...Really!? Then we could live peacefully again! Make sure you catch those bandits... I'll destroy the dam.","You're really strong. You beat me fair and square. I'll destroy the dam later. Please take care of those bandits."]},{"place":"Mirage Lake · after recovering the clan's home","passages":["I heard from my friends who were captured by the bandits...","You beat the bandit chief, didn't you? I'd expect nothing less from someone who beat me! I'm really impressed! Let me join you too! Please?","We're friends from now on! Nice to meet you, [your name]!","...Or so I thought, but it looks like your party is full. I'll head to the farm ahead of you. Come and see me there! I'm counting on you, [your name]!","...Or so I thought, but it looks like your farm is full.","Aw, come on! I think I could be pretty useful..."]}],"boss-bandit-leader":[{"place":"Bandits' Hideout","passages":["...Oh? You look familiar. Yes... You're the child I met at the shrine. I see. If you've come here, you must know what you're getting into. I am the leader of the bandits!","What? I don't look like a bandit? Ha ha ha! Well spotted! Being a bandit chief is merely a disguise. Those foolish humans are so eager to work when treasure is involved! If I offer the treasure they've gathered to my lord, the King of the World Between Worlds...","Oops! I've said too much. It's time for you to disappear! I needn't bother dealing with a child like you myself. Come forth, my servant!","Back again? You never learn! The result will be the same every time!","...You have some skill, I see. But is that really all you can do? Now, how about this?","What an annoying bunch of visitors. I have no time to waste dealing with all of you! Little master, I'll leave the treasure in your care for now. Look forward to our next meeting!"]}],"boss-western-cape-dancer":[{"place":"Cape Cave","passages":["Who are you?! This is our territory! We don't go easy on trespassers who come here to make a mess! Or did you come to challenge me?","You think a kid like you can beat me?! I'll make you dance till you drop!","Fighting you wouldn't be much fun anyway... I'll let you off. Now get out of here!","Come back as often as you like! You'll never beat me!","Oh! You're pretty strong. I like you! How about letting me join your team? Then I'll show you the greatest dance you've ever seen!","All right! I'm counting on you, partner!","Hmm... You've already got plenty of companions with you. Then I'll wait at the farm! See you there, partner!","Hmm... Your farm is full. There's no room for me...","Hmm... You're saying you don't want to see the greatest dance ever?"]}],"boss-ghost-ship-pirates":[{"place":"Ghost Ship · restless crew","passages":["...To d-die... before we could spend... our treasure...","The treasure... is ours... We won't give it... to anyone...","...Leaving our treasure behind... fills me with regret...","...Do not... examine the rope... at the bow..."]},{"place":"Ghost Ship · confrontation","passages":["...Who... disturbs... our slumber...? So... there are still those... who seek our treasure...","You fool... Learn... how powerless you truly are!","...Oh? You still don't understand...? The treasure... belongs to us...","Young one... We are defeated... At last... we can rest..."]}],"boss-northden-impostor":[{"place":"Northden Castle · posing as the king","passages":["Soldiers of Northden, listen well! I have decided to strengthen our army for the coming war with the western country. We must defend our families from those westerners who would steal our gold! In the name of the king of Northden, I command you to restore order to the border!","Who are you? I told the guards not to let anyone through. ...Hmph! The spirit's envoy? What foolishness is this? Very well. I shall at least explain the situation to you. Our kingdom was the first to lay claim to the gold vein in the border mine. I will never allow the western country to arrive later and claim our gold! In any case, the border must remain closed until the conflict ends!","I have nothing more to say to you. Leave at once.","What? You again!? Don't tell me you're claiming there's no gold in the mine too! Have those westerners tricked you into coming here to tell me what to do!?","You're no envoy of the spirit! You're a spy from the western country! You can rot in the dungeon!"]},{"place":"Northden Castle · the impostor exposed","passages":["Why do you keep questioning me!? Do you doubt me, ook...? Blast! I let an 'ook' slip!","...Curse you! My master ordered me to impersonate the king and start a conflict... You've ruined everything! You'll pay for this! Eek eek!","Ook ook... I'll kill everyone here and carry on with the plan! Starting with you!","I was so close! It's all your fault! Eek eek!","Eek... Eek... Don't think... this is over... My master... is still..."]}],"boss-yuna-puppet":[{"place":"Westernia Castle · the puppet","passages":["W-WAIT... DO NOT INTERFERE...","TO THINK SOMEONE WOULD FIND THE PRINCESS'S SOUL! BUT SHE WILL NEVER RETURN TO NORMAL UNLESS YOU DEFEAT ME. WILL YOU FIGHT ME, THEN?","YOUR LIFE ENDS HERE! PREPARE YOURSELF!","HEH HEH HEH... THEN BE GONE!","YOU DARE CHALLENGE ME? KNOW YOUR PLACE!","IF YOU WANT TO FIGHT ME, BRING THE PRINCESS'S SOUL!","I-IMPOSSIBLE... HOW COULD I..."]}],"boss-spring-attacker":[{"place":"Spirit's Spring · the attacker","passages":["So it was you who kept interfering with me... Once I steal the Sky Shield from the spirit... ...the King of the World Between Worlds will grant me even stronger monsters! If you still intend to stand in my way, you'll pay for it. Do you?","Ha ha! You fool! You think you can beat me when I'm serious!? It's too late for regrets!","Hmph. Very well, then. I'll spare you this time.","You never know when to give up. I'll show you how foolish you are. Come, my servants! Defeat them!","I-impossible! My monsters...! Curse it! This wasn't supposed to happen!"]}],"boss-lake-tower-wizard":[{"place":"Lake Tower · the wizard","passages":["Hmph... Have you come to capture me too? Yes, I scattered the Silencing Powder over the town... Why? Who knows... A man in black hired me. He said he'd pay me if I did it. Creating monsters costs money, you know. Heh heh... I shall use the monsters I've created to seize the kingdom... And prove that my research was right! Do you mean to interfere with my research too?","No one will interfere with my great research! Face the monsters I created!","What? Did you come all this way to become my assistant? Ha! As if a child could understand my research!","N-no... The monsters I created... Defeated..."]},{"place":"Lake Tower · the wizard's guardian","passages":["I'M GUARDING THIS PLACE ON THE PROFESSOR'S ORDERS. SORRY, BUT COULD YOU PLEASE TURN BACK?","I CAN'T FORGIVE ANYONE WHO GETS IN THE PROFESSOR'S WAY... YOU'LL HAVE TO DEAL WITH ME!","THE PROFESSOR IS SMARTER AND WISER THAN I AM. NOTHING IS IMPOSSIBLE FOR THE PROFESSOR!"]}],"boss-dead-king":[{"place":"Castle of the Dead · the king","passages":["You have come this far without fearing the monsters of my castle... Though you are a child, even I am impressed by your courage.","I see you command even those known as Demon Kings...","But if you want the treasure, you must first defeat me!","Mwa ha ha! You have returned! I acknowledge your bravery...","...You have defeated me. I can only call it... magnificent. ...Having lost, I shall honorably surrender the treasure. Farewell."]}],"boss-small-cave-guardian":[{"place":"Small Cave · the treasure guardian","passages":["Beat me, and you can have this treasure! Don't hold back just because I'm small!","Hey! I'll take you on anytime!","You're good! The treasure's yours, as promised."]}],"boss-sky-impostor":[{"place":"Demon King's Castle · posing as the Demon Lord","passages":["So you've made it this far! First, allow me to commend you.","I am Mudo, the great Demon Lord who reigns supreme over all monsters!","Now, show me the treasures you have brought.","...What?! You haven't brought them? Then why have you come?! Find the three treasures and bring them to me.","...Yes. These are indeed the rare treasures you promised. Very well! As promised, I shall grant your wish! But first, I must test whether you deserve to have it granted!","Heh heh heh... At last! I've been waiting for you! Now I shall test whether you deserve to have your wish granted!"]},{"place":"Demon King's Castle · identity revealed","passages":["Wait, [your name]! I give up! I was wrong! It's me! Kameha! Your rival, Kameha!","I never dreamed you were the one gathering those treasures, [your name]. Surprised? That's right! I'm the Demon Lord! While I was looking for a replacement navel, a huge bird carried me off... I found the Orb of Light in a treasure chest in its nest. But the orb wouldn't work as GreatLog's navel. So I used its power to become the Demon Lord and ordered my servants... To find a replacement for me! And they finally did! I'll show you. It's in the next room.","Looks like this could replace the navel, doesn't it? It's the spitting image! This time... No, this whole search for a navel is my victory! I got carried away and kept hunting for treasure, but I'm done now. I'd better get home soon. Dad might be getting worried.","Wh-who are you?! What do you want?!","Wh-wh-wh-what...? What just happened?!","Th-the treasures I had everyone gather! Was that you?! Give them back!","M-my treasures! He took every last one! That creep took my treasures... The ones I had everyone gather! ...Anyway, are you sure about this? Accepting a deal like that... He even wants the treasures you've found to replace the navel... Brought to his castle! It's got to be a trap!"]}],"boss-dark-master":[{"place":"Demon King's Castle · confronting the impostor","passages":["I heard everything. So that's what this was all about.","While Lord Darck, King of the World Between Worlds, was away, someone claimed the title of Demon Lord... And that someone is a human child! What an amusing little story!","As you can see, I've come to defeat this impostor of a Demon Lord. And the brat who's always interfering is here too. How fortunate... I'll deliver both of you to Lord Darck as gifts!","Hmph... Lord Darck has spared your lives! We'll settle this another day. Until then, our battle must wait..."]},{"place":"Darck's Manor · the final confrontation","passages":["Hmph... Finally. You're earlier than I expected. I'd like to settle all my scores with you here... But Lord Darck has ordered me to collect your treasures. Well? You've brought the treasures you promised, haven't you?","...What?! You haven't brought them?! Even you must realize how little time you have left...","...You've some nerve coming here without the treasures! But I cannot let you through until you bring every last one.","Hmph... Surprisingly obedient! Hand over the treasures, then.","Good. I've received them all. That's everything, isn't it?!","Now, take these to Lord Darck.","...Now even stronger monsters will add to my power. You have my heartfelt thanks. Heh heh heh... Power is everything to me... Might is the only justice I believe in...","What is this justice you believe in? Saving the world?! Protecting your family?! Can the powerless do either?! You and I both seek power. Our aims differ, but our methods are the same. We defeat those who stand in our way... The result is no different.","...Now, let us begin. This will be your final battle! The powerless shall perish!","It seems you still fail to grasp your own powerlessness... This time, I shall shatter that pathetic justice you believe in!","...I-impossible... My monsters... The strongest monsters... Defeated... A-are you saying... I was wrong...? I cannot believe it...! You are... stronger than I..."]}],"boss-darck":[{"place":"Demon King's Castle · the bargain","passages":["Wait, Dark Master. There's no need to be so hasty. These two went to such trouble to gather treasures for me.","A pleasure to meet you! I am Darck, King of the World Between Worlds! Ha ha ha! Give them back? The treasures of this world belong to me! Besides, you've snatched quite a few things away from me yourselves! Perhaps we're more alike than you think!","Anything that makes others envious or jealous... Is a treasure to me, and becomes my power. Can you comprehend the meaning of this power...?","I am Darck, the true Demon Lord! While I was away... You certainly gave my servants a great deal of trouble!","Honestly... Such incompetent servants are a terrible burden.","Now, time is short. Shall we get down to business? A replacement for GreatLog's navel, which you seek... Was among the treasures you returned to me, wasn't it? And you need it to save GreatLog, don't you? Ha ha ha! If you like, I'll trade it for the treasures you've gathered! Surely that sounds like a good deal to you?","You haven't much time left, have you? It's a perfectly reasonable offer... What do you say?","Then we have a deal! Ha ha! Here, take this key as a memento of our meeting.","This key should let you reach my castle. Bring the rest of your treasures there.","We'll be waiting with a proper welcome prepared. Until then, farewell!"]},{"place":"Darck's Manor","passages":["Ha ha! I've been expecting you! Welcome to my castle! Oh, yes. I've already received the treasures you brought! Such marvelous treasures! You are a model collector! ...You see, there are two types of collector. Those obsessed with collecting things of value only to themselves... And those who crave and collect the things others envy. They may seem alike, since both collect things... But the source of their energy is utterly different! The energy released by the vanity and greed sleeping deep in their hearts... Becomes my power. Ha ha ha!","I have the replacement for GreatLog's navel that you seek. Without it, an entire kingdom will perish! Nothing could bring me greater delight than this very moment! Envy me! Resent me! Those feelings are so delicious!","Now, defeat me, and this Mysterious Navel is yours... Sadly, however, you are going to die here. Your bitter regret will nourish me and become my energy... Ha! Ha! Ha!","Ha ha! Splendid! You've come all this way again! Just as I thought! You are the finest of collectors! Now, defeat me, and the treasure is yours! Unleash every last one of those feelings upon me!","...Wh-what? Me...? I see... So that's it... ...It seems... I was mistaken... You don't gather treasures out of vanity or greed... But for something else... Something I cannot understand... And... It gave me no power at all... You are the worst of collectors... And yet... ...You seem to have gathered the finest companions... Friends you can trust... Ugh... I am defeated. Open that treasure chest..."]}]}};
